<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">- Pogoro Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 Samueli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shitabu sha pili sha Samueli</para>
  <para style="toc2">Samueli</para>
  <para style="toc3">Sam</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shitabu sha pili sha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Samueli</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGULERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Pa kwanja vitabu avi 1 Samueli na vya 2 Samueli shiweriti ndo shitabu shimu hera shikulu shimanikiti handa shitabu sha Samueli, kwa mala ya kwanja shitabu ashi shibagulitwi na kuwera vitabu viwili mu mulilaviwu lya Biblia lyawalishemiti, (Septuaginta). Ali liweriti lipatanu ligona muutakulu wa Shiebrania lyalilembitwi kwa Shiyunani. Shisoweru ashi Septuaginta shilanguziya lipatanu ali ligona Mushiyunani shilembitwi na wabetula sabini ama sabini na mbili Washiyawudi. Mumalembu ga Shiyunani, 1 Samueli na 2 Samueli vishemitwi 1 ufalumi na 2 ufalumi shakapanu mulilaviwu lya Biblia muutakulu wa Shilatini vishemitwi 1 Wafalumi na 2 Wafalumi aku vitabu vya ufalumi vyeni vishemwa 3 Wafalumi na 4 Wafalumi. Vitabu vya Samueli gwa kwanja na Samueli gwa pili vipapa malawiru ga historia ya kulikala kwa Samueli yakaweriti mbuyi gwa Mlungu na mfalumi Sauli na mfalumi Dawudi, Samueli kaweriti ndo mlonguziya gwa upeleru, shaka isi ya Israeli payigalambukiti kulawa kukolwamlima na walonguziya na kukolamlima na Wafalumi. Samueli ndo yakawamiminiliti lipaki Sauli na Dawudi kuwera wafalumi wawili wa kwanja wa Israeli. Vitabu avi 1 Samueli na 2 Samueli vitakulira kwa mngati histoliya ya Israeli kwa shaka ashi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwahera yakavimaniti gaa ndo yakavilembiti vitabu vya Samueli gwa kwanja na gwa pili. Muntu yakalembiti kalikanda ndiri muvitabu avi kumbiti iranguziya kaweriti mkomu mushipindi sha upeleru sha mfalumi Dawudi ama nentu ya panu, viraa kaweriti na uwezu wa kuwona na kusoma vitabu vimonga vya matakuliru ga sauli na samueli. Toziya ya bada yayiweriti kwa walemba wa vitabu avi viraa vimanikana ndiri vilembitwi ndii.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yagawera amu</para>
  <para style="io">Dawudi kawera mfalumi gwa Yuda na shakapanu kawera mfalumi yakawatenditi wantu wa Israeli woyeri, mushipandi 1 mpaka 5</para>
  <para style="io">Mfalumi Dawudi kankukola mlima na kuwakanka wankondu wakuyi wavuwa, mushipandi 6 mpaka 10</para>
  <para style="io">Mfalumi Dawudi kankutenda uhumba na kulaga shakapanu kakalipilwa na mbuyi gwa Mlungu Natani, mushipindi sha 11 na 12</para>
  <para style="io">Dawudi kankugalambukwa kwa vipindi viwili gwekagweka, mushipandi sha 13 mpaka 20</para>
  <para style="io">Kumalilira kwa zyuma za ukolamlima wa Dawudi handa mfalumi, shipandi sha 22 mpaka 24</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2SA 1" />
  <para style="s">Dawudi wankumgambira kuhowa kwa Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 1:1" />Pakahowiti kala Sauli, Dawudi kawuyiti pakawakankiti kala Waameleki, kalikaliti Sikilagi kwa mashaka mawili. <verse eid="2SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 1:2" />Lishaka lyalifatiti, muntu yumu kulawa kulugonjeru lya Sauli, nguwu yakuyi payiwera kayideganga kwa kulanguziya hinginika na pakawera na lidiku kumtuwi kamgenderiti Dawudi. Pakasokiti kwa Dawudi, kaliyasiti pasi kulongolu kwakuyi kamsuntamalira. <verse eid="2SA 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 1:3" />Dawudi kamgambira, “Gulawa koshi?” Na yomberi kamgambira,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:3">“Ntoloka kulawa lugonjeru lwa Waisraeli.”<verse eid="2SA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 1:4" />Dawudi kamgambira,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:4">“Gung'ambili vitwatira vyaviweriti aku.” Muntu ulii kamwankula, “Wantu wetu wayituga nkondu na wamashonta wetu wavuwa walaguwa. Nentu ya aga, Sauli na mwana gwakuyi Yonatani viraa walaguwa.”<verse eid="2SA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 1:5" />Dawudi kamkosiya mntemba ulii, “Guvimana hashi handa Sauli na mwana gwakuyi wahowa?”<verse eid="2SA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 1:6" />Mntemba ulii kankula, “Ilawira paweriti kulogongu Giliboa. Nimwoniti Sauli kayegemera mgowa gwakuyi na mbutuka ya wakwena farasi ya wankondu wakuyi iweriti pakwegera nayu. <verse eid="2SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 1:7" />Sauli pakaloliti kumbeli, kamonoti, kanshema. Nitika, neni panu! <verse eid="2SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 1:8" />Yomberi kankosiyiti, gwenga gwa gaa? Neni nimgambira, neni na Mmaleki. <verse eid="2SA 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 1:9" />Shakapanu Sauli kalonga, gusegeleri gundagi toziya ntenduwa nentu na kutama kukalipa. Kumbiti ndo nankali mkomu. <verse eid="2SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 1:10" />Hangu, ng'enditi pakwegera na yomberi na kumlaga, toziya nivimana handa pakaguwa pasi hakahowi. Kumbiti lijenjeri lyaliweriti pamtuwi pakuyi na likembi lyaliweriti mmawoku mwakuyi, vyoseri nikujegera gwenga, mtuwa gwangu.”<verse eid="2SA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 1:11" />Dawudi kakola nguwu zakuyi na kuzipapula kwa kulangaziya hinginika nentu. Ata wantu yawaweriti pamuhera na Dawudi watenditi ntambu iraa. <verse eid="2SA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 1:12" />Walira na kudaya, na koya kuliya mpaka pamihi toziya ya kulaguwa kwa Sauli na mwana gwakuyi Yonatani na kuwalilira wantu wa isi ya Israeli weni ndo wantu wa Mlungu, toziya wantu wavuwa walagitwi kunkondu.<verse eid="2SA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 1:13" />Dawudi kamkosiya mntemba ulii yakamjegeriti visoweru, “Gulawa koshi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:13">Yomberi kankula, “Neni Mmaleki, kumbiti nilikala muisi yaku handa mhenga.”<verse eid="2SA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 1:14" />Dawudi kamkosiya, “Iweriti haa gwenga gutira ndiri kutalipisiya liwoku lyaku na kumlaga muntu yakasyagulitwi na Mtuwa Mlungu kwa kuswagwa lipaki?” <verse eid="2SA 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 1:15" />Shakapanu, Dawudi kamshema yumu gwa wantemba wakuyi kamgambira, “Gumlagi muntu ayu!” Mntemba ulii kamkoma Mmaleki ulii na kumlaga. <verse eid="2SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 1:16" />Dawudi kalonga, “Mlandu agu haguweri gwaku gamweni, toziya gulilanguziya gamweni pagulonga, nimlaga muntu yakasyagulitwi na Mtuwa Mlungu kwa kuswagwa lipaki.”<verse eid="2SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dawudi kankudaya kuhowa kwa Sauli na Yonatani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 1:17" />Dawudi kimbiti lwimbu lwa kudaya toziya ya Sauli na mwana gwakuyi Yonatani. <verse eid="2SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 1:18" />Dawudi kalongiti wantu wa Yuda wafundwi lwimbu alu lwa kudaya lweni lulembwa mushitabu sha Yashari. Dawudi kimba hangu.<verse eid="2SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 1:19" />“Mumigongu ya Israeli, wakulu wetu walaguwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:19">Mashonta wetu wagagamala waguwa!”<verse eid="2SA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 1:20" />“Shitwatira ashi namwagambira wantu wa mji gwa Gati</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">pota muvinjira vya mji gwa Ashikeloni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">Hera hangu, wadala wafilisti hawanemeleri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">Wahinga yawamumana ndiri Mlungu, hawanemeleri.”<verse eid="2SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 1:21" />“Mwenga migongu ya Giliboa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">namuwera na mangami ama mvula nayitowa pambindi penu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">Pota malambu genu mashaka goseri nagalaviya shoseri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">Toziya ngawu za wagangamala zilekwa aku mukusoniziwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">Ngawu ya Sauli iswagitwi ndiri lipaki.”<verse eid="2SA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 1:22" />Misali ya “Yonatani yendeleyiti kulaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">ligumba lya Sauli lyendeleye kulaga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">Mashaka goseri kalagiti wavuwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">Yina, ndagiti wagangamala.”<verse eid="2SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 1:23" />“Sauli na Yonatani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">waweriti pamuhera</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">Makaliru na kuhowa viwabagula ndiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">waweriti wayewuka handa ndapu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">nakaka, wana likakala kuliku simba.”<verse eid="2SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 1:24" />“Mwenga wahinga wa Israeli, mumliliri Sauli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:24">Kawavalasiyiti nguwu nsheri za ukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:24">kazilembiziyiti nguwu zyenu kwa zahabu.”<verse eid="2SA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 1:25" />“Ntambu gaa wagangamala waguwiti!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:25">Wahowa pawawera mumakomangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:25">Yonatani wamlaga kulugongu.”<verse eid="2SA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 1:26" />“Moyu gwaku gwana hinginika toziya yaku, mlongu gwangu Yonatani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">Guwera kwa neni mashaka goseri muntu gwa kufiliziya!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">Ufiru waku kwa neni uwera wa kulikankasha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">wa kulikangasha kuliku ufiru wa mdala.”<verse eid="2SA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 1:27" />“Mashonta wagangamala waguwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:27">na vintu vyawu vya kulikomangira konkondu vilekwa, vyahera lihengu.”<verse eid="2SA 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2SA 2" />
  <para style="s">Dawudi kankulumikwa kuwera mfalumi gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 2:1" />Pa vitwatira avi, Dawudi kamluwiti Mlungu shakutenda, kalonga, “Hashi, ng'endi kumji gumu gwawu gwa miji ya Yuda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira, “Gugendi!” Dawudi kamkosiya,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">“Ngendi mji goshi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Mtuwa Mlungu kamwankula, “Gugendi kumji gwa Hebroni.” <verse eid="2SA 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 2:2" />Hangu, Dawudi kagenditi Hebroni, pamuhera na wadala wakuyi wawili, Ahinoamu kulawa mji gwa Yezireeli na Abigaili, mkenja gwa Nabali, kulawa mji gwa Karimeli. <verse eid="2SA 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 2:3" />Kawatoliti wamashonta wakuyi, kila muntu pakawera pamuhera na kaya yakuyi na womberi wagenditi kulikala kumiji yayiweriti mbwegabwega mwa Hebroni. <verse eid="2SA 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 2:4" />“Wantu wa Yuda wamgenderiti Dawudi aku Hebroni wamswaga lipaki kaweri mfalumi gwawu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:4">Dawudi pakapikiniriti kuwera wantu wa Yabeshi mu Gileadi ndo yawamfintiriti Sauli,” <verse eid="2SA 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 2:5" />kawatumiti walagilagi aku Yabeshi mu Gileadi na ulagilagi, “Mlungu na kawatekereli toziya mlanguziyiti ujimira wenu kwa Sauli, mtuwa gwenu, kwa kumfintira. <verse eid="2SA 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 2:6" />Hangu, Mtuwa Mlungu kawatenderi maheri na kuwera mwaminika kwa mwenga. Na neni haniwatenderi uheri kulawirana na shitwatira shamshitenditi. <verse eid="2SA 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 2:7" />Hangu muweri mwana makakala na wagangamala. Sauli, mtuwa gwenu, kahowa na wantu wa Yuda wasyagula weri mafalumi gwawu na kuswaga lipaki.”<verse eid="2SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishibosheti katendwa kuwera mfalumi gwa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 2:8" />Abineri mwana gwa Neri, mkulu gwa lishonta lya Sauli kaweriti kamtola Ishibosheti mwana gwa Sauli na kumjega aku Mahanaimu. <verse eid="2SA 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 2:9" />Aku, Abineri kamswaga lipaki Ishibosheti kuwera mfalumi gwa isi ya Gileadi na Ashuru na Yezreeli na Efraimu na Benjamini na Israeli yoseri. <verse eid="2SA 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 2:10" />Ishibosheti kaweriti na vinja alubayini pakanjiti kuyikolamlima Israeli na yomberi kakolitimlima kwa vinja viwili.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:10">Kumbiti likabila lya Yuda liweriti uwega wa Dawudi. <verse eid="2SA 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 2:11" />Dawudi kaweriti mfalumi gwa likabila lya Yuda kwa vinja saba na nusu, makawu gakuyi gaweriti aku Hebroni.<verse eid="2SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkondu pakati pa wantu wa Israeli na wantu wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 2:12" />Aberi mwana gwa Neri, pamuhera na wakulu wa Ishibosheti na mwana gwa Sauli, wawukiti Mahinaimu na kugenda kumji gwa Gibioni. <verse eid="2SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 2:13" />Yoabu mawu gwakuyi wamshemiti Seruya na wantumintumi wamonga wa Dawudi na womberi walawiti na kuliwona na Abineri na wantu yawaweriti nawa kulitanda lyaliwera aku Gibioni. Shipinga shimu uwega wumu wa litanda na shipinga shimonga uwega umonga. <verse eid="2SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 2:14" />Abineri kamgambira Yoabu, “Guwaleki wantemba walikomangi kulongolu kwa twenga!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:14">Yoabu kankula, “yina.”<verse eid="2SA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 2:15" />Hangu wantemba ishilini na msheshi awa ndo walaviwa. Kulawa likabila lya benjamini na ishibosheti mwana gwa Sauli, wantemba lilongu na wawili na Dawudi wantemba lilongu na mbili.<verse eid="2SA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 2:16" />Kila muntu kalibatana na mnkondu gwakuyi mumtuyi na kulisomana kwa ligumba, hangu woseri wawili waguwa pasi, wahowa. Hangu, pahala panu pashemwa Helikati Gazurimu mana yakuyi luwaga lwa makomangu. Pahala panu paaku Gibioni.<verse eid="2SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 2:17" />Nkondu ya lishaka ali iweriti nkulu. Abineri na wantu wa Israeli wakomingitwi nentu na wantu wa Dawudi. <verse eid="2SA 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 2:18" />Wana watatu wa Seruya waweriti aku ndo, Yoabu na Abishai na Asaheli waweriti panu. Asaheri kaweriti katuga handa mbawala. <verse eid="2SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 2:19" />Asheri kamfatiti Abineri magenda pota kugalambuka kumliwu ama kumshigi. <verse eid="2SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 2:20" />Abineli pakaloliti kumbeli kamwona Asaheri,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:20">kamgambira, “Hashi, ndo gwenga Asaheri?” Yomberi kankula, “Yina, ndo neni.”<verse eid="2SA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 2:21" />Abineri kamgambira, “Guleki kunfata neni, guwafati wantemba na kutola lopola zawu.” Kumbiti Asaheli koya ndiri kumfata. <verse eid="2SA 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 2:22" />Shakapanu Abineli kamgambira Asaheli mala ya pili, “Goyi kunfata. Ntambu gaa nikulagi? Kaka gwaku Yoabu hakamoni hashi?” <verse eid="2SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 2:23" />Kumbiti Asaheli kapikaniriti ndiri. Hangu Abineli kamsoma mgoha kumtima shimberimberi na mgoha agu gulawira kumgongu kwa Asaheli, Asaheli kaguwa pasi na kuhowa palaapa. Wantu woseri yawasokiti pahala pakahowiliti Asaheli, wagoloka jii.<verse eid="2SA 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 2:24" />Kumbiti Yoabu na Abishai wamfatiti Abineli. Mshenji paguzyeta, wasoka kulugongu lwa Ama, lwaluwera kwagulawira mshenji kwa Gia, munjira yayigenda kushiwala sha Gibeoni. <verse eid="2SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 2:25" />Wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini walijojonira pamuhera wawera kumbeli kwa Abineri, hangu wanyawa vipinga vyawu na womberi wagoloka pampindi pa lugongu. <verse eid="2SA 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 2:26" />Shakapanu Abeneli kamshema Yoabu, “Hashi, hatulikomangi mashaka goseri? Hashi?, Guwona ndiri handa upeleru hawuweri utama? Hashi, hagwendereyi kwa shaka gaa pota kuwagambira wantu waku kuleka kuwafata Waisraeli wayawu?”<verse eid="2SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 2:27" />Yoabu kamgambira, “Handa Mlungu ntambu yakalikala, handa meguweri gwenilongi shitwatira ashi, nakaka, wantu mewendereyi kuwafata walongu wawu mpaka shirawu mandawira.” <verse eid="2SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 2:28" />Hangu, Yoabu kagomba mapenka na wantu waleka kuwafata wantu wa Israeli, su walikomanga ndiri kayi.<verse eid="2SA 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 2:29" />Abineri na wamashonta wakuyi wapititi kululalanda lwa Araba pashiru poseri. Waloka lushemba Yoridani, wagendagenda paliwala poseri mpaka Mahanaimu.<verse eid="2SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 2:30" />Yoabu pakawuyiti kulawa kumfata Abineli, kawajojonira wamashonta wakuyi woseri, kayambula kuwera wamashonta lilongu na tisa wa Dawudi kwahera, pota kumuwalanga na Asaheli. <verse eid="2SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 2:31" />Kumbiti wamashonta wa Dawudi waweriti wawalaga wantu miya tatu sitini kulawa likabila lya Benjamini pamuhera na wantu wa Abineli. <verse eid="2SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 2:32" />Yoabu na wamashonta wakuyi wayitoliti nshimba ya Asaheli, wayifintira kulisembi lya tati gwakuyi, lyaliwera aku Betilehemu. Yoabu na wamashonta wakuyi watyangiti pashiru poseri na payiweriti mandawira wasokiti kumji gwa Hebroni.<verse eid="2SA 2:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2SA 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 3:1" />Kuweriti na nkondu ya shipindi shitali pakati pa wantu yawamjimiliti Sauli na walii yawamjimiliti Dawudi. Kumbiti Dawudi kongeriti kupata likakala nentu na nentu na Sauli waweriti wahera likakala nentu.<verse eid="2SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wapalu wa Dawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 3:2" />Wana wapalu wa Dawudi wawiwukiti aku Hebroni, gwa kwanja kaweriti Amunoni mawu gwakuyi kaweriti Ahinoamu kulawa Yezireeli, <verse eid="2SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 3:3" />mwana gwa pili kaweriti Kileabu, mawu gwakuyi kaweriti Abigaili mkenja gwa Nabali kulawa Karimeli, gwa tatu kaweriti Abisalomu, mawu gwakuyi kaweriti Maaka, mhinga gwakuyi Talimai mfalumi gwa Geshuri. <verse eid="2SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 3:4" />Mwana gwa msheshi kaweriti Adoniya, mawu gwakuyi kaweriti Hagiti, mwana gwa mhanu kaweriti Shefatia, mawu gwakuyi kaweriti Abitali. <verse eid="2SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 3:5" />Mwana gwa sita kaweriti Itereamu, mawu gwakuyi kaweriti Egila, Wadala wakuyi Dawudi wamwiwuliriti wana woseri awa pakaweriti aku Hebroni.<verse eid="2SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abineri kankuwera pamuhera na Dawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 3:6" />Nkondu payendereyiti pakati pa wamashonta wa Dawudi na wantu wa Sauli, Abineri kongeriti kuligangamaziya.<verse eid="2SA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 3:7" />Sauli kaweriti na mdala yumu gwa kunja yawamshema Misipa, mwana gwa Aya. “Su, shipindi shimu, Ishibosheti kamkosiya Abineri, ntambu gaa gugonja na mdala gwa kunja gwa tati gwangu?” <verse eid="2SA 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 3:8" />Abineri kakalaliti nentu kulawirana na visoweru vya Ishibosheti, kalonga, “Hashi, gulihola neni weza kumgalambuka Sauli? Hashi, gulihola neni nauwega wa Yuda?” Guloli, neni wera mwaminika kwa kaya ya tati gwaku Sauli na walongu wakuyi na waganja wakuyi nikutenda ndiri gusindi na Dawudi mpaka leru. “Ata hangu, leru gumona kuwera nana likosa toziya ya mdala! <verse eid="2SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 3:9" />Mlungu na kantagi pawera neni hapantendi goseri geni Mlungu kamgambiriti hakatendi kwa Dawudi. <verse eid="2SA 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 3:10" />Mlungu kamlapiliti Dawudi kuwera hakauhamiziyi ufalumi kulawa kwa Sauli na kumpanana yomberi. Yomberi hakakolimlima Israeli na Yuda kulawa Dani aku kushana mpaka Beya Sheba aku kusika!” <verse eid="2SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 3:11" />Ishibosheti kaweza ndiri kulonga shintu, toziya kaweti kamtira nentu Abineri.<verse eid="2SA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 3:12" />Su, Abineri katuma walagilagi kwa Dawudi, aku Hebroni wakamgambiri, “Hashi, isi ayi hakakolimlima gaa, vinu gutendi lipatanu na neni na neni hanikutangi kuyitenda Israeli yoseri guyikolimlima gwenga.”<verse eid="2SA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 3:13" />Dawudi kankula, “Nakaka, hantendi lipatanu na gwenga. Kumbiti nikufira shitwatira shimu handa pamberi hagweni moni gunjegeri uti Mikali mhinga gwa Sauli. Shakapanu hatuliwoni.” <verse eid="2SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 3:14" />Dawudi viraa katuma walagilagi kwa Ishibosheti mwana gwa Sauli pakalonga, “gumbuzilili mdala gwangu Mikali yanimyugiti kwa vinduli miya yimu vya Wafilisti.” <verse eid="2SA 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 3:15" />Su, Ishibosheti katumiti wantu wamtola Mikali kulawa kwa mpalu gwakuyi, Palitieli mwana gwa Laishi. <verse eid="2SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 3:16" />Kumbiti Palitieli kagenda pamuhera na mdala gwakuyi agawu pakalira njila yoseri mpaka aku Bahurimu. Abineri kamgambira Palitieli, “Guwuyi ukaya.” Na yomberi kawuya,<verse eid="2SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 3:17" />Abineri kayowera na wazewi wa Israeli, kawagambira, “Kwa shaka shitali muweriti mmufira Dawudi kaweri mfalumi gwenu. <verse eid="2SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 3:18" />Vinu mtendi aga toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiliti hangu Dawudi, kwa liwoku lyaku gwenga Dawudi ntuminintumi gwangu, haniwalopoli wantu wangu wa Israeli kulawa kwa Wafilisti na kulawa wankondu wawu wamonga.” <verse eid="2SA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 3:19" />Abineri viraa kayowera na wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini, shakapanu wagenda mpaka Hebroni kumgambira Dawudi kuusu galii wantu woseri wa Israeli na likabila lyoseri lya Benjamini shawapataniti kutenda.<verse eid="2SA 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 3:20" />Abineri pakamgendereti Dawudi, kaweriti na wantu ishilini, Dawudi kawatandiriti msambu na kuwapanana shiboga na virandu. <verse eid="2SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 3:21" />Pa shiboga kupera Abineri kamgambira Dawudi, “Neni vinu hang'endi mtuwa gwangu mfalumi. Hawizi na kutenda majimiranu na gwenga, su guweri mfalumi gwawu na gwenga haguwakolimlima woseri ntambu yagufira.” Dawudi kamgambira nembuka Abineri na yomberi kawuka kwa ponga.<verse eid="2SA 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abineri kankulaguwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 3:22" />Shakapanu, Yoabu na wantu wamu wa Dawudi wawuyiti kulawa mumakomangu, wajega lopola zivuwa. Kumbiti Abineri kawera ndiri pamuhera na Dawudi aku Hebroni toziya Dawudi kaweriti kamgambiriti nembuka kagendi zakuyi na yomberi kawuka kwa ponga. <verse eid="2SA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 3:23" />“Yoabu pakawuyiti na lishonta lyakuyi lyoseri lyakaweriti nalu, kagambiluwa handa Abineri mwana gwa Neri, kaweriti kiza kumwona mfalumi Dawudi na yomberi kalonga nembuka kagendi zakuyi na Abineri kawuka kwa ponga.” <verse eid="2SA 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 3:24" />Yoabu kamgenderiti mfalumi na kumgambira, “Vinu gutenda shishi? Guloli Abineri kiziti kwaku, ntambu gaa gumleka kagenda? <verse eid="2SA 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 3:25" />Hashi, guvimana kuwera Abeneri mwana gwa Neri kiziti kukupayira? Kiziti su kavimani makakala ga lishonta lyaku na goseri gagutenda!”<verse eid="2SA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 3:26" />Yoabu pakalawiti kuyowera na Dawudi, katumiti walagilagi wambati Abineri na womberi wamwona kulinegu lya Sira na kumwuziya, kumbiti Dawudi kavimaniti ndiri shitwatira ashi. <verse eid="2SA 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 3:27" />Abineri pakawuyiti Hebroni, Yoabu kamtola na kumwingiziya kushumba sha mngati kuligomi likulu handa kafira kuyowera na yomberi kwa bada. Shakapanu Yoabu kamsoma Abineri kumtima toziya Abineri kaweriti kamlaga Asheri mlongu gwakuyi na Abineri kahowa. <verse eid="2SA 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 3:28" />Shakapanu Dawudi pakapikiniriti visoweru avi kalongiti, “Neni na ufalumi wangu twahera likosa kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kwa kulaguwa kwa Abineri mwana gwa Neri. <verse eid="2SA 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 3:29" />Malaguwa aga hagaweri pampindi pa mtuyi gwa Yoabu na kwa kaya yoseri ya tati gwakuyi! Nakamu hakuweri na muntu munumba ya Yoabu yakana ulweri kulawa ufira, ama ungumbula ama yakatyangira luhonga ama yakaguwa kwa ligumba ama yakahera shiboga!” <verse eid="2SA 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 3:30" />Yoabu na mlongu gwakuyi Abishai wamlagiti Abineri toziya kaweriti kamlaga mlongu gwawu Asaheri shaka sha nkondu aku Gibeoni.<verse eid="2SA 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufindirwa kwa Abineri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 3:31" />Shakapanu, mfalumi “Dawudi kamgambira Yoabu na walii woseri yawaweriti pamuhera na yomberi, wapapuli nguwu zawu, wavala nguwu za mafafa su wamdayiliri Abineri. Shaka pawagenditi kufintira, mfalumi Dawudi kagendegenditi kumbeli kumashera.” <verse eid="2SA 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 3:32" />Abineri kafintilitwi aku Hebroni na mfalumi kadayiti kwa liziwu pakawera kumbeku kulisembi, viraa wantu woseri watenditi ntambu iraa ayi. <verse eid="2SA 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 3:33" />Mfalumi kamdayilira Abineri pakalonga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 3:33">“Hashi, iwera hashi Abineri kahowa gambira mngalimahala?<verse eid="2SA 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 3:34" />Mawoku gaku gatawalirwa ndiri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 3:34">na magulu gaku gatawalilwa ndiri pingu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 3:34">Kahowa handa muntu yakalagitwi na wakontola!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 3:34" />
  <para style="m" vid="2SA 3:34">Na wantu woseri wamliliriti kayi.<verse eid="2SA 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 3:35" />Shakapanu, wantu woseri wagenditi kumzyangazya Dawudi kalii shintu shoseri shaka shashiweriti shankali paliwala. Kumbiti Dawudi kalirapa kamgambira, “Mlungu na kandagi pandawalira shintu shoseri mpaka mshenji pagwinala!” <verse eid="2SA 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 3:36" />Wantu woseri yawawoniti vitwatira avi na womberi wafiliziwitwi, handa kila shintu shakatenditi mfalumi shiwafiliziyiti. <verse eid="2SA 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 3:37" />Hangu, lishaka lilii, Waisraeli woseri wavimaniti handa iweriti ndiri nfiru ya mfalumi Dawudi kumlaga Abineri mwana gwa Neri. <verse eid="2SA 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 3:38" />Mfalumi Dawudi kawagambiriti wantumintumi wakuyi, “Hashi, muvimana ndiri kuwera leru mkulu na muntu yakamanikana nentu kahowa mu Israeli? <verse eid="2SA 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 3:39" />Tembera swagwa lipaki su weri mfalumi, kumbiti leru neni nahera likakala. Awa wana wa Seruya ndo wandewu nentu. Mtuwa Mlungu na kawatozi teratera na ukontola wawu!”<verse eid="2SA 3:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2SA 4" />
  <para style="s">Ishibosheti kankalaguwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 4:1" />Ishibosheti mwana gwa Sauli, pakapikiniriti handa Abeneri kalaguwa aku Hebroni, moyu gwakuyi gutwezuka kwa kutira na wantu woseri wa israeli walishera. <verse eid="2SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 4:2" />Ishibosheti mwana gwa Sauli, kaweriti na wantu wawili yawaweriti walongoziya wa vipinga vya ukangala, yumu wamshemiti Baana na yumonga Rekabu. Awa waweriti wana wa Rimoni, muntu gwa likabila lya Benjamini kulawa mji gwa Beeroti, toziya Beeroti viraa guweriti lunda ya likabila lya Benjamini. <verse eid="2SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 4:3" />Wenikaya wa Beeroti watugiriti Gitaimu na wendeleya kulikala aku mpaka leru.<verse eid="2SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 4:4" />Yonatani mwana gwa Sauli, kaweriti na mwana magulu gakuyi galeweleka. Mwana ayu wamshemiti Meshibosheti na pakaweriti na vinja mhanu visoweru vya kuhowa kwa Sauli na Yonatani pazipikinitwi kulawa Yezireli. Yaya yakaweriti kamlolera pakapikiniriti kuwera Sauli na Yonatani walaguwa aku Yezereeli. Kamtoliti Meshibosheti katuga nayu. Kumbiti pakaweriti kakutuga nayu kalongola mwana ayu katuluka, kawera shikwawakwawa.<verse eid="2SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 4:5" />Rebeka na Baana mwana gwa Rimoni Mbeeroti, wagenda ukaya kwa Ishibosheti. Wasokiti aku pashimihi, Ishibosheti pakaweriti. Kankukwoyera ukaya kwakuyi. <verse eid="2SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 4:6" />Wingiliti mnumba pawalitenda handa wafila kutola nganu, wamwona Ishibosheti kagonja kushitanda kwakuyi mngati munumba mwa shumba shakuyi sha kugonja, wamsoma mgoha kumtima wamlaga. <verse eid="2SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 4:7" />Pawamlagiti kala, walongu wawili awa wamlikituliti mtuyi watoloka pawawera wagutola mtuyi agu. Wapita njira ya Araba, wagenda mwanja gwa pashiru poseri. <verse eid="2SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 4:8" />Shakapanu wamjegera Dawudi aku Hiburoni. Na womberi wamgambira mfalumi Dawudi, “Agu ndo mtuyi Ishibosheti mwana gwa Sauli mweni ndo mnkondu gwaku, yakaweriti kafira kukulaga. Mtuwa Mlungu leru kamuwuzilira mfalumi gwangu kwa kumkoma Sauli na wana wakuyi.”<verse eid="2SA 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 4:9" />Kumbiti Dawudi kamwankula Rekabu na Baana, mlongu gwakuyi, wana wa Rimoni, Mbeeruti. “Handa Mlungu ntambu yakalikala, yomberi kankombola neni muntabiku zoseri! <verse eid="2SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 4:10" />Muntu ulii yakiziti kung'ambira kuwera Sauli kahowa, kavimaniti handa kanjegera visoweru viheri, nimubatiti na kumlaga aku. Hangu iweriti ndo lifupu lyanimupiti kulawirana na ulagilagi wakuyi! <verse eid="2SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 4:11" />Muntu mkontola pakamlaga muntu mheri pakawera pashitanda ukaya kwakuyi, hashi, nfiruwa ndiri kumwuzilira toziya ya kulaga muntu ayu, kwa kumlaga muntu ayu!” <verse eid="2SA 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 4:12" />Dawudi kawagambira wamashonta wakuyi na womberi wawalaga Mekabu na Baana. Wawabata mawoku gawu na magulu gawu. Shakapanu wawatyetiziya kumtera kumbeku kulitanda aku Hebroni. Shakapanu watoliti mtuyi gwa ishibosheti na kufintira mlisembi lya Abineri aku Hebroni.<verse eid="2SA 4:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2SA 5" />
  <para style="s">Dawudi kankuwera mfalumi gwa Israeli na Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 11:1-9">1 Mirandu 11:1-9</ref>,<ref loc="1CH 14:1-7">14:1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 5:1" />Shakapanu wantu woseri wa Israeli wamgenderiti Dawudi aku Hebroni na kumgambira, “Guloli, twenga ndo walongu waku nakamu. <verse eid="2SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 5:2" />Mashaka gapititi, Sauli mfalumi gwetu gwenga ndo guwalongoliti Waisraeli munkondu na Mlungu kakugambiriti haguweri mlolera gwa wantu waneni Israeli na haguweri mkolamlima gwa Israeli.” <verse eid="2SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 5:3" />Su, wazewi woseri Israeli wamgendera mfalumi Dawudi aku Hebroni na yomberi katenda lipatanu na womberi kulongoru kwa Mtuwa Mlungu na kumswaga lipaki kuwera mfalumi gwa Israeli. <verse eid="2SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 5:4" />Dawudi kaweriti na vinja selasini pakanjiti kukolamlima na kakolitimlima kwa shaka shavinja arobaini. <verse eid="2SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 5:5" />Aku Hebroni, Dawudi kakolitimlima wantu wa Yuda kwa shaka sha vinja saba na myezi sita na aku Yerusalemu kakolitimlima wantu wa Israeli pamuhera na Yuda kwa shaka sha vinja selasini na tatu.<verse eid="2SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 5:6" />Lishaka limu mfalumi na wantu wakuyi wagenditi Yerusalemu kuwakomanga Wayebusi yawaweriti wenikaya wa mji agu. Kumbiti womberi wamgambira Dawudi, “Hapeni gwingiri kumji agu.” Toziya wana lwisi na vikwawakwawa hawakuwingiri kutali kumji agu. Wamgambiriti hangu toziya waliholiti handa “Dawudi hapeni kingili kumji agu.” <verse eid="2SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 5:7" />Hata hangu, mfalumi Dawudi kalilopoliti liboma lya Siyoni, lweni lushi lwa Dawudi.<verse eid="2SA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 5:8" />Lishaka ali, Dawudi kalongiti, “Muntu yoseri yakafira kuwakoma Wayebusi na kapitiri kulushemba lwa mashi su kukomanga vikwawakwawa na wanalwisi weni awa rohu ya neni iwakalalira,” Toziya wantu walonga, “Wanalwisi na vikwawakwawa hapeni wingiri mnumba nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="2SA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 5:9" />Dawudi kalikaliti kuliboma ali na lushi lweni kalushema, lushi lwa Dawudi. Shakapanu Dawudi kanyawiti lushi kuluzyengeta, kanjiriti Milo mpaka mngati. <verse eid="2SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 5:10" />Na Dawudi kongereka kuwera na makakala nentu toziya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Mashonta, kaweriti pamuhera na yomberi.<verse eid="2SA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 5:11" />Shakapanu, mfalumi Hiramu gwa Tiro kawalagalira walagilagi kwa Dawudi, kamjegiliti viraa mierezi, wasongola mbawu na wasongola mabuwi weni yawamnyawiriti Dawudi liboma. <verse eid="2SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 5:12" />Hangu, Dawudi kavimana handa Mtuwa Mlungu kamtenda kaweri mfalumi gwa Israeli na kawukuliziya ufalumi wakuyi toziya ya wantu wakuyi wa Israeli.<verse eid="2SA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 5:13" />Dawudi kalitoliliti wadala wa kunja na wadala wakayugiti nentu aku kumji gwa Yerusalemu pakalawiti kala Hebroni. Awa wamleleriti wana nentu wapalu na wadala. <verse eid="2SA 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 5:14" />Aga ndo matawu ga wana wapalu, wadala wakuyi yawamwiwuliliti aku Yerusalemu: Shamua na Shobabi na Natani na Selemani, <verse eid="2SA 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 5:15" />Ibihari na Elishua na Yafia, <verse eid="2SA 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 5:16" />Elishama na Eliada na Elipeleti.<verse eid="2SA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dawudi kakuwakanka Wafilisti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 14:8-17">1 Mirandu 14:8-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 5:17" />Wafilisti pawapikiniriti handa Dawudi wamwitira lipaki kuwera mfalumi gwa Israeli, wamashonta woseri walawa kugenda kumsakula, kumbiti yomberi kapatiti visoweru, kingira mngati mwa liboma. <verse eid="2SA 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 5:18" />Vinu Wafilisti wasokiti na kuliyananga kululalanda lwa Refaimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 5:19" />Su, Dawudi kamkosiyiti Mtuwa Mlungu shakutenda, “Hashi, ng'endi kuwakomanga Wafilisti? Hashi, hagutendi niwakanki?” Na Mlungu kamgambira Dawudi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 5:19">“Gugendi, toziya nakaka hanikutendi guwakanki Wafilisti!”<verse eid="2SA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 5:20" />Su, Dawudi kasoka Baali Perasimu na kawakanka Wafilisti. Shakapanu kalonga, “Mlungu kapita pakati pa wankondu wangu handa lilawa lya mashi yagatuga.” Hangu pahala panu pashemuwa Baaali Perasimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 5:21" />Wafilisti wavilekiti vinyagu vyawu vya wamlungu pahala panu na Dawudi na wantu wakuyi wavitola vinyagu avi.<verse eid="2SA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 5:22" />Kwa mala ya pili, Wafilisti wasokiti kayi na kuliyananga kululalanda la Refaimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 5:23" />Dawudi kamluwiti Mtuwa Mlungu shakutenda, Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira “Naguwakomanga kulawa paguwera, ila guzyengeti na kuwakomanga kulawa pakwegera na mitera ya Mizabibu. <verse eid="2SA 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 5:24" />Katepu pampikinira kulindima handa liziwu lya lishonta lyankupita kuupeleru wa mizabibu ayi, panu guligangamaziyi toziya neni Mtuwa Mlungu haweri ndawira su kukulongoleri kulikoma lishonta lya Wafilisti.” <verse eid="2SA 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 5:25" />Dawudi katenditi ntambu yakagambiritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu na yomberi kawakomanga Wafilisti kulawa Geba mpaka Gezeri.<verse eid="2SA 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2SA 6" />
  <para style="s">Lisandiku lya lipatanu lyakujegwa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 13:1-14">1 Mirandu 13:1-14</ref>,<ref loc="1CH 15:25-16:6">15:25-16:6,43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 6:1" />Dawudi kawajojoniriti wantu elufu selasini wa Israeli yawasyagulitwi. <verse eid="2SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 6:2" />Yomberi na wantu wakuyi woseri walawa Bala ya Yuda wajega lisandiku lya Mlungu kulawa aku, lyalimaniziya litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu yakana makakala, mweni kalikala muukulu wakuyi yawuwera pampindi pa lisandiku ali. <verse eid="2SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 6:3" />Shakapanu, walitola lisandiku lya Mlungu kulawa mnumba ya Abinadabu yakaweriti kulugongu, walikweneziya mumbutuka ya syayi ya kukwegwa na ng'ombi. Uza na Ahio wana wa Abinadabu waweriti wankwendesha mbutuka yasyayi ayi, <verse eid="2SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 6:4" />Ahio kaweriti kalongolera kulongolu kulisandiku ali lya Mlungu. <verse eid="2SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 6:5" />Dawudi na wantu woseri wa Israeli, pawawera wankwimba lwimbu na kuvina kwa likakala lyawu lyoseri, kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Pawagomba zezi na vinubi na vinanda na matali na kayamba na matowazi.<verse eid="2SA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 6:6" />Pawasokiti kuluwaga lwa kukomera viboga vya Kidoni, Uza kalitalipisiyiti liwoku lyakuyi na kulikola lisandiku lya Mtuwa Mlungu toziya wang'ombi walii walikwaliti. <verse eid="2SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 6:7" />Panu, maya ga Mtuwa Mlungu gakalipa kwa Uza. Mtuwa Mlungu kamlaga palapalii. Uza kahowa palapalii kumbwega kulisandiku lya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 6:8" />Na Dawudi kakalaliti kwa kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamtendiriti Uza kwa maya. Hangu, pahala palii pashemwa Peresi Uza mpaka leru.<verse eid="2SA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 6:9" />Lishaka ali Dawudi kamtiriti Mtuwa Mlungu pakalonga, “Vinu halinizili hashi kwaneni lisandiku lya Mtuwa Mlungu?” <verse eid="2SA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 6:10" />Hangu, Dawudi kaweriti ndiri kala kulijega lisandiku lya Mtuwa Mlungu mngati mwa lushi lwa Dawudi, ila Dawudi kalijegiti ukaya kwa Obedi Edomu, muntu gwa kulawa mji gwa Gati. <verse eid="2SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 6:11" />Lisandiku ali lya Mtuwa Mlungu lilikaliti ukaya kwa Obedi Edomu miyezi mitatu na Mtuwa Mlungu kamtekelera Obedi Edomu pamuhera na kaya yakuyi.<verse eid="2SA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 6:12" />“Mfalumi Dawudi pakapikiniriti kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu kawatekelera walongu wa Obedi Edomu na vintu vyoseri vyakaweriti navi toziya ya lisandiku la Mtuwa Mlungu, hangu Dawudi kagenda kulitola lisandiku lya patanu kulawa ukaya kwa Obedi Edomu na kujega kulushi lwa Dawudi kwa sheleku nkulu.” <verse eid="2SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 6:13" />Wantu walii yawalijegiti lisandiku lwa Mtuwa Mlungu kila pawagenditi atuwa sita, Dawudi kalaviyi tambiku ya ng'ombi shipalu na ng'ombi shididini yumu kanenepa. <verse eid="2SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 6:14" />Dawudi pakaweriti kalitawa nguwu yakuvala pashifuwa kalitawa mshunu mwakuyi kavina kwa likakala lyakuyi lyoseri kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 6:15" />Hangu, yomberi na Waisraeli woseri walijegiti lisandiku lya Mtuwa Mlungu mpaka kumji gwa Dawudi kwa nemeleru na liziwu likulu lya talumbeta.<verse eid="2SA 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 6:16" />Lisandiku lya Mtuwa Mlungu paliweriti lyankwingira kumji gwa Dawudi, Mikali mhinga gwa Sauli kasunguliliti kulidilisha kamwona mfalumi Dawudi kankugulukaguluka na kuvina kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Su, kamwona shintu ndiri kumoyu kwakuyi. <verse eid="2SA 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 6:17" />Shakapanu waliyingiziya lisandiku lya Mtuwa Mlungu mngati mulilingu lyakalinyawiti Dawudi na kalitula lisandiku ali pahala pakuyi. Na Dawudi kalaviya tambiku za kulunguziya na tambiku za ponga kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 6:18" />Dawudi pakamaliliti kulaviya tambiku za kulunguziya na za ponga, kawatekeleriti wantu kwa litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu yakana uwezu, <verse eid="2SA 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 6:19" />na kawabagulira wantu woseri wa Waisraeli shiboga, wapalu na wadala, kila yumu kampanana libumunda na shipandi sha shinofu na libumunda lya zabibu. Shakapanu, wantu woseri wawukiti, kila muntu kawuya ukaya kwakuyi.<verse eid="2SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 6:20" />Dawudi pakawuyiti ukaya kwakuyi su kuwatekelera wantu wa kaya yakuyi, Mikali mhinga gwa Sauli, kagenditi kumwanka pakalonga, “Iwera hashi leru mfalumi gwa Israeli kalipanana ndiri ligoya na kugendagenda shivula kulongolu kwa wantumintumi wakuyi wapalu na wadala handa mngali mahala ntambu yakavula nguwu zakuyi kulongolu kwa wantu pota soni!”<verse eid="2SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 6:21" />Dawudi kamgambira Mikali, “Weriti nankuvina kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu mweni kasyaguliti neni pa tati gwaku na walongu waku, su kasyagula neni weri mkulu kwa Israeli, wantu wakuyi Mtuwa Mlungu, hangu neni havini hera kulongolu kwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2SA 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 6:22" />Neni hanilisulusiyi namweni nentu kuliku vinu. Gwenga gumona neni shintu ndiri, kumbiti awa wantumintumi wadala yaguwatakula hawampanani neni ligoya!”<verse eid="2SA 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 6:23" />Su Mikali mhinga gwa Sauli kaweriti ndiri na mwana mpaka kuhowa kwakuyi.<verse eid="2SA 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2SA 7" />
  <para style="s">Natani kamjegera ulagilagi Dawudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 17:1-15">1 Mirandu 17:1-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 7:1" />Mfalumi Dawudi pakaweriti kankulikala kuliboma lyakuyi na Mtuwa Mlungu kampanana ponga kulawa kwa wankondu wakuyi woseri, <verse eid="2SA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 7:2" />mfalumi kamgambira Natani, mbuyi yakaweriti mbuyi gwa Mlungu, “Guloli vinu, neni nilikala mnumba ya mitera ya mibani, ila lisandiku lya Mtuwa Mlungu lilikala mngati mliringu.”<verse eid="2SA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 7:3" />Natani kamgambira mfalumi, “Gugendi gwakatendi shoseri shaguliholera mmoyu mwaku, kwa kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu ka pamuhera na gwenga.” <verse eid="2SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 7:4" />Kumbiti pashiru palapalii Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Natani, <verse eid="2SA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 7:5" />“Gugendi gwakamgambili ntumintumi gwangu Dawudi, Mtuwa Mlungu kalongi ntambu ayi hashi, gwenga hagunyawiri numba ya kulikala? <verse eid="2SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 7:6" />Kwanjira lishaka lilii paniwalaviyiti Waisraeli kuisi ya Misri mpaka leru nilikala ndiri kunumba. Ntyanga kila pahala pawera nilikala mliringu. <verse eid="2SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 7:7" />Kila pahala pang'enditi na Waisraeli woseri hanenimkosiyi mkulu yoseri yanimsyaguliti kuwalonguziya wantu wa neni Israeli ntambu gaa gunyawira ndiri numba ya mitera ya mibani?”<verse eid="2SA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 7:8" />“Su, gumgambiri ntumintumi gwangu Dawudi, Mtuwa Mlungu gwa Mashonta kalonga hangu, nikulaviyiti mmaliwuziyu kwaguweriti gwankuwalolera kondolu, su guweri mkulu gwa wantu waneni Israeli. <verse eid="2SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 7:9" />Kwanjira shaka ashi wera pamuhera na gwenga koseri kwagugenditi na niwalaga wankondu kulongolu kwaku koseri. Hanikutendi kuwera gumanika handa wakulu wamonga pasipanu. <verse eid="2SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 7:10" />Neni haniwasyaguliri wantu wangu wa Israeli pahala pa kulikala, su walikali pahala pawu weni pota kuwoniluwa kayi. <verse eid="2SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 7:11" />Na wantu wandewu yawatendera likakala hapeni wawatabisiyi kayi handa mashaka gapititi.Kwanjira shaka paniwasyaguliti walonguziya kwa wantu waneni Israeli na neni hanikuloleri kulawirana na wankondu woseri. Kayi neni Mtuwa Mlungu hanikubweleri kuwera hanikupanani wiwuka hawuweri wafalumi. <verse eid="2SA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 7:12" />Paguhowaku na kufintirwa na kuwera pamuhera na wambuyi waku, hanimtendi yumu gwa wana waku gamweni gwenga kaweri mfalumi na neni haniwutendi ufalumi wakuyi uweri na makakala. <verse eid="2SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 7:13" />Yomberi ndo yakafira kunyawa numba toziya yaneni na haniwutendi ufalumi wakuyi hawulikali mashaka goseri. <verse eid="2SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 7:14" />Neni haweri tati gwakuyi na yomberi hakaweri mwana gwangu. Pakatenda makontola, hanimsyatangi gambira muntu ntambu yawakamsyatanga mwana gwakuyi kwa mboku. <verse eid="2SA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 7:15" />Kumbiti hapeni mbusiyi ufiru wangu kwakuyi ntambu yambusiyiti kwa Sauli, yanimwusiyiti kulongolu kwaku. <verse eid="2SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 7:16" />Hantendi yimu ya numba yaku hawakolimlima mashaka goseri.”<verse eid="2SA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 7:17" />Natani kamgambira Dawudi kila shintu shakalanguziwitwi mumalola aga na Mlungu.<verse eid="2SA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dawudi kankulonga mayagashii</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 17:16-27">1 Mirandu 17:16-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 7:18" />Shakapanu mfalumi Dawudi kingira Muliringu linanagala na kulivaga kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, shakapanu kaluwa, “Neni na gaa, gwee Mtuwa Mlungu na kaya yangu ndo shishi ata gunyasula mpaka panu pawera leru. <verse eid="2SA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 7:19" />Kayi shitwatira ashi shiweriti shididini pamasu paku gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, nentu ya aga gulonga haguwatenderi wantu wa kaya yangu mirandu mikulu muvinja vivuwa vyaviza hashi ndo ntambu yaguwatendera wantu! <verse eid="2SA 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 7:20" />Nikugambili shishi vinu, neni ntumintumi gwaku Dawudi? Gwenga gumana neni ntumintumi gwaku, gwee Mtuwa Mlungu! <verse eid="2SA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 7:21" />Kulawirana na shii shagutakuliti na kwa kufira kwaku, gutenda makulu goseri aga su gunfundi neni ntumintumi gwaku. <verse eid="2SA 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 7:22" />Kulawirana na gatupikiniriti, gwenga Mtuwa Mlungu ndo mkulu. Kwahera yakawera handa gwenga na kwahera Mlungu gwingi ila gwenga. <verse eid="2SA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 7:23" />Kayi ndo wantu gaa pasipanu weni waweza kulinganira na wantu waku Israeli, weni Mlungu gwakuyi kagenditi kuwalopola su waweri wantu wakuyi? Gwenga Mlungu gutenda vitwatira vikulu vya kulikangasha toziya ya wantu waku yaguwalopuliti kulawa Misri na kukutenda gumaniki pasipanu poseri. Kayi guwawinga wantu wa maisi gamonga na wamulungu wawu kulongolu kwawu. <verse eid="2SA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 7:24" />Guwagangamaziya wantu waku wa Israeli toziya yaku gamweni, su waweri wantu waku mashaka goseri na gwenga Mtuwa Mlungu guwera Mlungu gwawu.”<verse eid="2SA 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 7:25" />“Su, vinu, gwenga Mtuwa Mlungu, guyimaliri ntakula yagung'ambiliti neni ntumintumi gwaku na viraa na kaya ya neni ntambu yagulongiti. <verse eid="2SA 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 7:26" />Litawu lyaku halikwiswi mashaka goseri na wantu hawalongi, Mtuwa Mlungu yakana uwezu ndo Mlungu yakakolamlima Israeli.’ Na walongu wangu, neni Dawudi ntumintumi gwaku, hawagangamali kulongolu kwaku. <verse eid="2SA 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 7:27" />Toziya gwenga, Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu yakana uwezu, Mlungu gwa Israeli! Gung'ubutulira neni ntumintumi gwaku, pagulonga hanikunyawiri numba, toziya ayi neni ntumintumi gwaku ntirandiri kulaviya luwa ayi kulongolu kwaku.”<verse eid="2SA 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 7:28" />“Vinu, gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, gwenga ndo Mlungu na visoweru vyaku ndo nakaka na gung'ambira neni ntumintumi gwaku mlandu agu mheri. <verse eid="2SA 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 7:29" />Hangu, nikuluwa kaya ya neni ntumintumi gwaku ipati kulikali mashaka goseri kulongolu kwaku, toziya gwenga Mtuwa Mlungu gulonga hangu, viraa kwa tekelera zaku kaya ya neni hayitekelerwi mashaka goseri.”<verse eid="2SA 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2SA 8" />
  <para style="s">Ukanka wa Dawudi kunkondu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 18:1-17">1 Mirandu 18:1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 8:1" />Pa aga, Dawudi kawakomiti na kuwakanka Wafilisti na kugutola mji gwa Metegi Ama na vijiji vyakuyi vyaviweriti vikolwamlima na Wafilisti.<verse eid="2SA 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 8:2" />Shakapanu kawakankiti Wamoabu. Kawatula mumistali walopolwa awa na kuwagonjeka pasi. Kahimiziya walii yawawera kumistali miwili walagwi na walii wa mstali gwa tatu walekwi. Hangu, Wamoabu wawera wantumintumi wakuyi Dawudi na wawera wankumlipa kodi.<verse eid="2SA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 8:3" />Dawudi viraa kamkankiti Hadadizeri mwana gwa Rehobi, mfalumi gwa Soba. Dawudi kapatiti ukanka awu shaka sha Hadadizeri pakaweriti mnjira kugenda kupawuziya pahala papaweriti lushemba Eufrata kuwera pasi pa ukolamlima wakuyi. <verse eid="2SA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 8:4" />Dawudi kalopoliti wakwena farasi elufu yimu na miya saba na mashonta wagenda kwa magulu ishilini elufu. Shakapanu Dawudi kalikituliti mishipa ya kumbeli ya farasi woseri wa mbutuka za kukwega, ila kasigaziyiti farasi wa kutoshela mbutuka miya yimu.<verse eid="2SA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 8:5" />Waaramu wa Dameski pawagenditi kumtanga Hadadizeri, mfalumi gwa Soba, Dawudi kawakomiti na kuwalaga wantu ishilini na mbili elufu. <verse eid="2SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 8:6" />Shakapanu Dawudi katuliti ng'onjeru za shishonta kumji gwa Waaramu wa Dameski. Hangu, Waaramu wawera wantumintumi wakuyi na wawera wankumlipila kodi. Mtuwa Mlungu kampananiti Dawudi ukanka koseri kwakagenditi. <verse eid="2SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 8:7" />Dawudi kazitoliti ngawu za zahabu zyawapapiti wakulu wamashonta wa Hadadizeri na kuzijega Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 8:8" />Viraa katoliti shaba zivuwa nentu kulawa miji ya Beta na Berotai, yayiweriti ukolwamlima na Hadadizeri.<verse eid="2SA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 8:9" />Mfalumi Toi gwa Hamati, pakapikiniriti handa Dawudi kalikankiti lishonta lyoseri lya Hadadezeri. <verse eid="2SA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 8:10" />Kamlagaliliti mwana gwakuyi Yoramu kwa mfalumi Dawudi kumlamsiya na kuzyuma toziya kaweriti kalikomiti na Hadadizeri na kumkanka. Hadadizeri kalikomiti na toi mala zivuwa. Yoramu kamjegeriti Dawudi mafupu ga vyombu vya madini ga feza na zahabu na shaba. <verse eid="2SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 8:11" />Mafupu aga, pamuhera na feza na zahabu zyakaweriti kazilopola kwa maisi goseri gakagakangiti, kazilaviyiti kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, <verse eid="2SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 8:12" />vintu avi vilawiti isi ya Edomu na Moabu na Amoni na Filistia na Ameleki, pamuhera na lopola zyakalopoliti kwa mfalumi Hadadezeri, mwana gwa Rehobu mfalumi gwa Soba.<verse eid="2SA 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 8:13" />Dawudi kaweriti kungera kumanika kwakuyi. Pakaweriti kankuwuya pakamkankiti kala Hadadezeri, kawalagiti Waedomu elufu lilongi na nani, mlulalanda lwa munu. <verse eid="2SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 8:14" />Katula ng'onjeru za shishonta mu Edomu yoseri. Na Waedomu woseri wa aku wawera wantumintumi wakuyi. Mtuwa Mlungu kampananati Dawudi ukanka koseri kwakagenditi.<verse eid="2SA 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 8:15" />Hangu, Dawudi kakolamlima Israeli yoseri na kawera pakawatendera wantu woseri ntambu yaifiruwa pota kumbagula muntu yoseri. <verse eid="2SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 8:16" />Yoabu mwana gwa Seruya, kaweriti mkulu gwa mashonta. Yehoshafati mwana gwa Ahiludi, kaweriti kalemba goseri yagalawira su nawagalyaluwa. <verse eid="2SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 8:17" />Sadoki mwana gwa Ahitubu na Ahimeleki mwana Abiatali waweriti watambika, Seraya kaweriti mlemba. <verse eid="2SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 8:18" />Benaya mwana gwa Yehoyada kaweriti mlonguziya gwa walolera wakuyi Dawudi yawashemitwi Wakereti na Wapeleti na wana wa Dawudi waweriti Watambika.<verse eid="2SA 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2SA 9" />
  <para style="s">Dawudi na Mefibosheti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 9:1" />Lishaka limu, Dawudi kakosiyiti, “Hashi, kwana muntu yoseri yakasigaliti mukaya ya Sauli? Handa kwanayu, menfiri kumtendera maheri toziya ya Yonatani.”<verse eid="2SA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 9:2" />Kuweriti na ntumintumi gwa walongu wa Sauli yawamshemiti Siba. Siba wamshemiti kugenda kwa Dawudi. Mfalumi Dawudi kamkosiyiti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:2">“Hashi gwenga ndo Siba?” Yomberi kankula, “Yina, neni ndo ntumintumi gwakuyi Siba.”<verse eid="2SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 9:3" />Mfalumi kamkosiya, “Hashi, kwahera muntu yakasigala mukaya ya Sauli? Handa kwanayu, menfiri kumtendera maheri ga Mlungu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:3">Siba kamwankula, “Kwana mwana gwa Yonatani, kumbiti yomberi ndo shikwawakwawa.”<verse eid="2SA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 9:4" />Mfalumi kamkosiya, “Ka koshi?” Siba kankula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:4">“Ka ukayu kwa Makiri mwana gwa Amieli aku Lo Debali.” <verse eid="2SA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 9:5" />Su, Mfalumi Dawudi kawalagalira wantu na yomberi kajegwa kulawa mnumba ya Makiri mwana gwa Amieli aku Lo Debari.<verse eid="2SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 9:6" />Mefibosheti mwana gwa Yonatani viraa mzukulu gwa Sauli wagenda kwa mfalumi Dawudi, waguwa makukama kulongolu kwa mfalumi Dawudi. Dawudi kamshema, “Mefibosheti.” Yomberi kamwankula, “Yina! Neni panu ntumintumi gwaku”<verse eid="2SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 9:7" />Dawudi kamgambira, “Nagutiara. Neni hanikutenderi maheri toziya ya tati gwaku Yonatani. Litapaka lilii lyoseri lyaliweriti lya mbuyi gwaku Sauli hanikuwuziliri. Gwenga mashaka goseri hagulii pameza pa neni.”<verse eid="2SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 9:8" />Mefibosheti kasuntamala na kulonga, “Neni na handa ng'ang'a kafuwa, ntambu gaa guntenderi ntambu ayi?”<verse eid="2SA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 9:9" />Shakapanu mfalumi Dawudi kamshema Siba ntumintumi gwa Sauli, kamgambira, “Lunda yoseri ilii yayiweriti ya Sauli na ya kaya yakuyi nimpanana mzukulu gwa mtuwa gwaku. <verse eid="2SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 9:10" />Gwenga na wana waku na wantumintumi waku hamuweri mwankumlimira Mefibosheti na hammujegeri mabenangu su mzukulu gwa mtuwa gwaku kaweri na shiboga mashaka goseri. Kumbiti yomberi hakaliyi pameza pangu.” Shaka ashi, Siba kaweriti na wana wapalu lilongu na mhanu na wantumintumi ishilini.<verse eid="2SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 9:11" />Shakapanu, Siba kamgambira mfalumi, “Neni ntumintumi gwaku, hantendi goseri gagulongiti.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:11">Su, Mefibosheti kawera kankupata shiboga shakuyi pameza pa Dawudi, handa yumu gwawu gwa wana wa mfalumi. <verse eid="2SA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 9:12" />Mefibosheti kaweriti na mwana mdidini mpalu yawamshemiti Mika. Wantu woseri wa walongu wa Siba waweriti wantumintimi wa Mefibosheti. <verse eid="2SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 9:13" />Hangu, Mefibosheti yakaweriti shikwakwawa kankulikala kumji gwa Yerusalemu na kupata shiboga shakuyi pameza pa mfalumi mashaka goseri.<verse eid="2SA 9:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2SA 10" />
  <para style="s">Dawudi kankuwakanka Waamoni na Waashuru</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 19:1-19">1 Mirandu 19:1-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 10:1" />Pa aga ayu mfalumi Nashashi gwa Waamoni kahowa na mwana gwakuyi yawamshemiti Hanuni kawera mfalumi pa tati gwakuyi. <verse eid="2SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 10:2" />Mfalumi Dawudi kalonga, “Hanimtenderi uheri Hanuni, mwana gwa Nashashi handa tati gwakuyi ntambu yakantenderiti.” Hangu, Dawudi katumiti walagilagi kugenda kumkola mawoku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 10:2">Na walagilagi wa Dawudi pawasokiti muisi ya Waamoni, <verse eid="2SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 10:3" />Wakulu wa Waamoni wamgambiriti mtuwa gwawu, Hanuni, “Hashi, gulihola handa Dawudi kwa kukutumira wantu kwiza kukukola mawoku kulanguziya kampanana ligoya tati gwakuyi? Hashi, Dawudi kawatuma ndiri wantu awa kwaku su kululolalola lushi shakapanu walulopoli?”<verse eid="2SA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 10:4" />Su, Hanuni kawabatiti walagilagi awa wa Dawudi kamumoga kila yumu uwega wumu wa shirevu shakuyi, kazideganga nguwu zawu pakati mpaka kumataku, shakapanu kawaleka wagendi zawu. <verse eid="2SA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 10:5" />Wawoniti soni kuwuya ukaya. Dawudi pakagambiritwi visoweru avi katuma wantu kuwawanka toziya walagilagi awa wawoniti soni nentu. Na mfalumi kawagambira, “Mlikali kumji gwa Yeriku, mpaka pamumera ndevu, shakapanu muwuyi ukaya.”<verse eid="2SA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 10:6" />Waamoni pawawoniti kuwera wamkalaziya Dawudi, wakoditi mashonta Waalamu elufu ishilini yawagenda kwa magulu kulawa Beti Rehobu na Soba, mashonta elufu kumi na mbili, kulawa Tobu na mfalumi Maaka pakawera na wamashonta elufu yimu<verse eid="2SA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 10:7" />Dawudi pakapikiniriti visoweru avi, kamtuma Yoabu kugenda na lishonta loseri la wagangamala. <verse eid="2SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 10:8" />Waamoni walawiti na kulipanga kala kwa nkondu ligomi likulu lwa mji gwa Raba, ali liweriti liboma lyawu. Waalamu kulawa Soba na Rehobu na wantu kulawa Tobu na Maaka walipangiti kushiwala.<verse eid="2SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 10:9" />Yoabu pakawoniti kuwera nkondu ikalipa kwa yomberi, kulongolu na kumbeli, kawasyaguliti wamu wa mashonta wa Waisraeli wagangamala nentu kawapanga su kulikoma na Waalamu. <verse eid="2SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 10:10" />Mashonta wamonga walii wasigaliti kawatuliti pasi pa ulonguziya wa mlongu gwakuyi Abishai, na yomberi kawapanga su walikomangi na Waamoni. <verse eid="2SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 10:11" />Yoabu kamgambira Abishai, “Payiwera Waaramu hawanganki, haguntangi kumbiti handa Waamoni hawakukanki, hanizi kukutanga. <verse eid="2SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 10:12" />Kumbiti guliyupi moyu! Tulikomi pota kutira toziya ya wantu wetu na toziya ya mji gwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwetu na yomberi Mlungu hakatutenderi lilii lyakawona ndo liheri kwakuyi!”<verse eid="2SA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 10:13" />Su, Yoabu na wantu wakuyi wagenditi kulongolu kugenda kulikoma na Waalamu na womberi Waaramu watira. <verse eid="2SA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 10:14" />Waamoni pawawoniti kuwera Waaramu watira, na womberi viraa wamtira Abishai na wingira mjini. Yoabu kaleka kulikoma na Waamoni, kawuya Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 10:15" />Kumbiti Waalamu pawawoniti handa Waisraeli wasinda, walijojonira pamuhera. <verse eid="2SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 10:16" />Hadadezeri kalagalira Waalamu yawaweriti kumwambu kulushemba Eufrati wajegwi, wagegerwi aku Helamu pawalonguziwa na Shobaki mkulu gwa lishonta lya hadadizeri. <verse eid="2SA 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 10:17" />Dawudi pakapatiti visoweru avi, kawajojonira pamuhera Waisraeli woseri, kaloka lushemba Yoridani na kugenda mpaka Helamu. Waaramu womberi walipangiti kala su walikomangi nkondu na Dawudi, wanja kulikoma na yomberi. <verse eid="2SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 10:18" />Kumbiti Waalamu watiliti kulongolu kwa Waisraeli. Dawudi kawalagiti Waalamu mia saba yawaweriti waendesha mbutuka za nkondu na wakwena farasi elufu alubaini. Viraa wamtenditi Shobaki mkulu gwa lishonta lyawu na yomberi kahowa palapalii. <verse eid="2SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 10:19" />Shakapanu wafalumi yawaweriti wantumintumi wa Hadadezeri pawawoniti kuwera wasinda na Waisraeli, watenditi lipatanu lya ponga na Israeli na womberi wajimirwa kukolwamlima na Israeli. Hangu Waalamu wajeriti ndiri kayi kuwatanga Waamoni.<verse eid="2SA 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2SA 11" />
  <para style="s">Dawudi na Betisheba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 11:1" />Mumwanjiru gwa shinja sha syayi, shaka shilii wafalumi pawagenditi kunkondu, Dawudi kamlagaliliti Yoabu na wakulu wakuyi pamuhera na Waisraeli woseri kulikoma na womberi wawakomiti na wawalopuliti Waamoni na kuluzyengeta mji gwa Raba. Kumbiti Dawudi kasigala Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 11:2" />Lishaka limu, shaka sha pashimihi, Dawudi kimuka kushitanda kagenda kulitala lya liboma lyakuyi. Pakaweriti kankutyanga aku kumpindi, kamwona mdala yumu yakoga mashi, mdala ayu kaweliti kaherepa nentu. <verse eid="2SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 11:3" />Dawudi kamlagaliliti muntu kumkosiya mdala ayu ndo gaa. Muntu ayu kamgambira Dawudi “Mdala ayu ndo Betisheba mhinga gwa Eliabu na mdala gwa Uria muntu gwa likabila lya Hiti.” <verse eid="2SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 11:4" />Su, Dawudi kawalagalila walagilagi wamjegi. Betisheba kiza kwa Dawudi, Dawudi kagonja nayu, mdala ayu kaweriti kalipunga hera kulawa mumashaka gakuyi ga mwezi shakapanu kawuya ukaya kwakuyi. <verse eid="2SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 11:5" />“Mdala ayu kapata yinda na yomberi katuma visoweru kwa Dawudi kuwera handa kana yinda yakuyi.”<verse eid="2SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 11:6" />Su, Dawudi kawalagalila wantu wamjegeri Yoabu ulagilagi yaulonga hangu, “Gumjegeri Uria muntu gwa likabila lya Hiti kwaneni.” Na yomberi kamlagalila Uriya kwa Dawudi. <verse eid="2SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 11:7" />Uriya pakasokiti kwakuyi, Dawudi kamkosiyiti visoweru vya Yoabu na wantu woseri na ntambu ya nkondu. <verse eid="2SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 11:8" />Shakapanu Dawudi kamgambira Uriya, “Guwuyi ukaya kwaku gwakwoyeri.” Uriya kalawa ukaya kwa mfalumi na mala mfalumi kamjegera lifupu. <verse eid="2SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 11:9" />Kumbiti Uriya kawuyiti ndiri ukaya kwakuyi, ila kagonja pamuhera na walolera woseri wa mtuwa gwakuyi kuligomi likulu. <verse eid="2SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 11:10" />Dawudi pakagambilitwi handa Uria kagenda ndiri ukaya kwakuyi, Dawudi kamkosiya Uria, “Gwenga gulawa mwanja, ntambu gaa gugenda ndiri ukaya kwaku?”<verse eid="2SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 11:11" />Uria kamwankula Dawudi “Lisandiku lya patanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu, pamuhera na mashonta woseri wa Israeli na Yuda walikala kuvisasa kunkondu. Mtuwa gwangu Yoabu na wantumintumi waku woseri watula ng'onjeru kushiwala, hayiweri hashi neni ng'endi ukaya nikalandi na kuliya na kugonja na mdala gwangu? Ntambu kulila mumoyu mwaku yayendereya kulikala, hapeni ndendi shintu sha ntambu ayi.”<verse eid="2SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 11:12" />Shakapanu, Dawudi kamgambira Uria, “Su, gulikali panu leru viraa na shirawu hanukuleki guwuyi.” Hangu Uriya kasigala kumjini Yerusalemu lishaka ali. Lishaka lyalifatiti, <verse eid="2SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 11:13" />Dawudi kamshemeriti Uria kuliya na kulanda ukaya kwakuyi, kamtenda Uria kaloweri. Ata hangu, pashiru palii Uria kagenda ndiri ukaya kwakuyi, ila kagonja muulili wakuyi pamuhera na walolera wa mtuwa gwakuyi.<verse eid="2SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 11:14" />Mandawira yakuyi, Dawudi kamlembera luhamba Yoabu na kampa Uriya kaijegi kwa Yoabu. <verse eid="2SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 11:15" />Muluhamba alu Dawudi kalemba hangu, “Gumtuli Uria kulongolu, pahala pa makomangu makulu nentu, shakapanu gumleki aku na kuwuya kumbeli su kakomangwi, kafuwi.” <verse eid="2SA 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 11:16" />Su, Yoabu pakaweriti kankuguzyengeta mji kamtula Uria pahala peni kavimana handa mashonta wa wankondu wawu waweriti wagangamala nentu. <verse eid="2SA 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 11:17" />Mashonta wa wankondu walawa na kulikomanga na Yoabu. Wamu wa wantumintumi wa Dawudi, walagitwi. Uria yakaweriti muntu gwa likabila lya Hiti na yomberi kalagitwi Viraa.<verse eid="2SA 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 11:18" />Shakapanu, Yoabu kajega visoweru vyoseri kwa Dawudi pakamgambira ntambu ya nkondu. <verse eid="2SA 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 11:19" />Yoabu kamgambiziya ntumintumi ayu yakamlagaliliti hangu, “Pakamgambiti kala mfalumi vitwatira vyoseri ntambu ya nkondu, <verse eid="2SA 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 11:20" />pakakalala na kukukosiya, ntambu gaa mgenditi pakwegera na mji pamuweriti mwankulikomanga? Mmaniti ndiri handa memgumwi misali kulawa kushibambaza sha mji gwawu? <verse eid="2SA 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 11:21" />Gaa kamlagiti Abimeleki mwana gwa Yerubesheti? Kaweriti ndiri mdala yumu kumji gwa Tebesi mweni kayasiti libuwi lya kusagira kulawa kushibambaza na libuwi limlaga Abimeleki? Su gwenga hagumgambiri hangu, ata ntumintumi gwaku Uria yakaweriti muntu gwa likabila lya Hiti na yomberi kahowa.”<verse eid="2SA 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 11:22" />Mlagilagi ulii kagenda kwa Dawudi na kumgambira goseri gakalagalilitwi na Yoabu kagatakula. <verse eid="2SA 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 11:23" />Mlagilagi ulii kamgambira Dawudi, “Wankondu wetu waweriti na likakala kuliku twenga, walawiti kunja kumji na kutukomanga kushiwala. Hangu twenga tuwawuziyiti mpaka kuligomi lya mji. <verse eid="2SA 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 11:24" />Shakapanu watuguma misali twenga wantumintumi waku kuwala kushibambaza. Wamu wa wantumintumi waku walagitwi. Ata ntumintumi gwaku Uria yakaweriti muntu gwa likabila lya Hiti kahowa.”<verse eid="2SA 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 11:25" />Dawudi kamgambira mlagilagi ulii, “hagumgambiri hangu Yoabu, shitwatira ashi nashikugaziya toziya ligumba lyahera masu, nkondu imlaga muntu yoseri ulii. Su, gongeri makomangu na guguhalibisiya mji agu. Ndo ntambu ya kumpanana moyu Yoabu.”<verse eid="2SA 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 11:26" />Betisheba mdala gwa Uria pakapikiniriti handa mpalu gwakuyi kahowa, kamdayilira mpalu gwakuyi. <verse eid="2SA 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 11:27" />Shaka sha kudayilira pashiperiti, Dawudi kalagalira Betisheba katolwi na kujegwa ukaya kwakuyi. Betisheba kawera mdala gwa Dawudi na yomberi kamlelera mwana mpalu. Kumbiti shitwatira ashi shakalitenditi Dawudi shimkalaziyiti Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="2SA 11:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2SA 12" />
  <para style="s">Natani kankulagalirwa kwa Dawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 12:1" />Su Mlungu kamlagalila Natani yakaweriti mbuyi gwa Mlungu kwa Dawudi. Natani kamgendera Dawudi, kamgambira, “Kuweriti na wapalu wawili kumji gumu, yumu kaweriti mlunda na yumonga kaweriti mhushu. <verse eid="2SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 12:2" />Mlunda ulii kaweriti na kondolu wavuwa na ng'ombi wavuwa. <verse eid="2SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 12:3" />Kumbiti mhushu ulii kaweriti na mwanakondolu mdidini jinta, mweni kaweriti kamhemera. Kamtuliti weri na mweni kakula ukaya kwakuyi pamuhera na wana wakuyi. Kamliiziyiti mwanakondolu ayu shiboga shirashilii handa shakuyi na kulandiziya shikombi shakuyi na yomberi viraa kaweriti pakamkisikira pashifuwa. Mwanakondolu ayu kaweriti gambira mhinga kwa muntu ulii mhushu. <verse eid="2SA 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 12:4" />Lishaka limu, mlunda ulii kamwiziliti mhenga. Su, mlunda ayu kafiliti ndiri kutola yumu gwa kondolu wakuyi mweni ama ngo'mbi gwakuyi, kamlikitulili mhenga gwakuyi,ila kagenditi na kumpoka mhushu ulii mwanakondolu gwakuyi, kamlikitilira mhenga gwakuyi.”<verse eid="2SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 12:5" />Dawudi pakapikiniriti aga, kamkalalira mlunda ulii. Kamgambira mbuyi Natani, “Nulilapa kwa Mlungu yakawela mkomu kwa muntu ayu yakatenditi shitwatira ashi kafiruwa kuhowa! <verse eid="2SA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 12:6" />Su mpaka kamlipi mhushu ayu mwanakondolu, kayi mala mheshi, toziya katenda shitwatira shidoda na kawera ndiri na lusungu!”<verse eid="2SA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 12:7" />Natani kamgambira Dawudi, “Gwenga ndo muntu ayu, vinu, Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, kalonga hangu. Nikuswagiti lipaki guweri mfalumi gwa Israeli na nikulopola mumawoku mwa Sauli. <verse eid="2SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 12:8" />Nikupananiti numba ya mtuwa gwaku na wadala wakuyi, kayi hanikupanani wantu wa Israeli na wa Yuda guwakolimlima. Na handa aga megaweri madidini kwa gwenga menikongeleri mala mbili nentu ga aga. <verse eid="2SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 12:9" />Ntambu gaa, gujimila ndiri visoweru vya neni Mtuwa Mlungu na gutenda ukontola awu kulongolu kwa neni? Gumlaga Uria muntu gwa likabila lya Hiti, kwa ligumba, gumtola mdala gwakuyi kaweri mdala gwaku. Guwaleka Waamoni kumlaga Uria kunkondu! <verse eid="2SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 12:10" />Hangu su, toziya gumpanana ndiri ligoya na gumtola mdala gwa Uria yakaweriti muntu gwa likabila lya Hiti, kuwera mdala gwaku, wamu wa wantu wa kaya hawalaguwi kwa ligumba. <verse eid="2SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 12:11" />Gupikinili, Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga, guloli, hanjegi makomangu mukaya mwaku gamweni. Haniwatoli wadala waku pagulola kwa masu gaku gamweni na kumpanana gwapakwegera gwaku na yomberi hakagonji nawa paweru <verse eid="2SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 12:12" />Gwenga gutenditi shitwatira ashi kwa bada, kumbiti neni hantendi aga kulongolu kwa Waisraeli woseri paweru.”<verse eid="2SA 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 12:13" />Su Dawudi kamgambira Natani, “Ntenda shidoda kwa Mtuwa Mlungu,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:13">Natani kamwankula, “Mtuwa Mlungu kakulekiziya shidoda shaku na gwenga hapeni guhowi. <verse eid="2SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 12:14" />Toziya ya kumjimira ndiri Mtuwa Mlungu, mwana gwaku hakahowi.” <verse eid="2SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 12:15" />Shakapanu Natani kawuya ukaya kwakuyi.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2SA 12:15">Mwana gwa Dawudi kankuhowa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:15">Mtuwa Mlungu kamkomiti mwana gwa Batisheba mdala gwa Uria yakamleleriti Dawudi na yomberi kawera mlweri nentu. <verse eid="2SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 12:16" />Dawudi kamluwa Mlungu mwana kaweriti mbaka. Kwoya kuliya na kagenda kushumba kwakuyi na pashiru poseri kagonja pasi. <verse eid="2SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 12:17" />Wazewi wakulu yawaweriti wankumlolera Dawudi munumba ayi wamfatiti na kumluwa kimuki, kumbiti yomberi kalemiti na koya kuliya shiboga pamuhera na womberi. <verse eid="2SA 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 12:18" />Pamashaka saba, mwana ayu kahowa. Wantumintumi wa Dawudi watiriti kumgambira kuwera mwana kahowa, toziya waliholiti, “Mwana ayu pakaweriti mkomu, tuyowiriti nayu, kumbiti katupikinira ndiri. Vinu, tumgambiri hashi kuwera mwana gwakuyi kahowa? Kaweza kutenda shintu shidoda.”<verse eid="2SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 12:19" />Dawudi pakawawoniti wantumintumi wakuyi wankuninitirana, kayambula kuwera mwana gwakuyi kahowa. Hangu, kawakosiya, “Hashi, mwana kahowa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:19">Nawomberi wamwakula, “Yina, kahowa.”<verse eid="2SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 12:20" />Dawudi kagoloka, koga mashi, kaliswaga lipaki na kuvala nguwu zimonga. Shakapanu kagenda kunumba nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu na kumguwira. Shakapanu kawuya ukaya na kaluwa shiboga, wampanana na yomberi kaliya. <verse eid="2SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 12:21" />Wantumini wakuyi wamkosiya, “Ndo shitwatira gaa ashi shagutenditi? Mwana pakaweriti mkomu, gwenga goyiti kuliya na kumlilira. Kumbiti pakahowiti, gugoloka, guliya shiboga!”<verse eid="2SA 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 12:22" />Dawudi kawawankula, “Nakaka mwana pakaweriti mkomu, noyiti kuliya na kulila. Ndenditi hangu toziya niliholiti, gaa kavimana? Pamonga Mtuwa Mlungu kamoneri lusungu su mwana kalikali. <verse eid="2SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 12:23" />Kumbiti vinu kahowa, toziya gaa noyi kuliya? Hashi neni mbeza kumuwuziya pasipanu? Lishaka limu hang'endi aku kwakagenditi, kumbiti yomberi kaweza ndiri kuwuya kwa neni.”<verse eid="2SA 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwiwuka kwa Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 12:24" />Shakapanu Dawudi kamzyangazyanga Betisheba mdala gwakuyi. Kagonja nayu na yomberi kapata yida na kulera mwana mpalu, mweni Dawudi kamshemiti Selemani. Mtuwa Mlungu kamfiliti mwana ayu, <verse eid="2SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 12:25" />Na yomberi kamlagalila Natani mbuyi gwa Mlungu kwa Dawudi kuwera kamshemi mwana ayu Yedidia mana yakuyi yakafilitwi na Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="2SA 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dawudi kankugulopola mji gwa Raba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 20:1-3">1 Mirandu 20:1-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 12:26" />Shaka ashi, Yoabu kagukomangiti mji gwa Raba muisi ya Waamoni na kagulopola mji agu gwa shifalumi. <verse eid="2SA 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 12:27" />Yoabu kalagalila ulagilagi kwa Dawudi, “Nigukomanga mji gwa Raba na neni niyitola mbwiru yawu ya mashi. <verse eid="2SA 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 12:28" />Vinu guwajojonili wamashonta woseri yawasigaliti, gutuli lugonjeru kuzyengeta mji agu na kugulopola. Hera hangu, panugulopola, wantu hawankwisi neni.” <verse eid="2SA 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 12:29" />Hangu, Dawudi kajojonira wamashonta woseri kagenda Raba, kalukomanga na kugulopola mji agu. <verse eid="2SA 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 12:30" />Shakapanu katola lijenjeri kulawa kushinyagu sha mfalumi kumtuwi gwakuyi. Utopa wa lijenjeri ali lya zahabu uweriti kilu selasini na mhanu na mngati mwakuyi muweriti na libuwi lya madini ga feza na katola libuwi ali nakulitula mulijenjeri lyaluyi. Na yomberi kalopoliti lopola zivuwa kumji agu. <verse eid="2SA 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 12:31" />Shakapanu kawatola wantu wa mji agu, kawatula watendi lihengu pawatendera msumenu, sululu za shuma, mawagu ga shuma na kuwatendera kutenda lihengu mutanulu lya matofali, hangu ndo yakazitenditi miji yoseri ya Waamoni. Upeleru wakuyi Dawudi na wantu woseri wawuyiti Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2SA 13" />
  <para style="s">Amunoni na Tamali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 13:1" />Abisalomu, kaweriti na dada gwakuyi kaherepa yawamshemiti Tamali. Ilawiriti Amunoni mwana yumonga mpalu gwa Dawudi, kamfiriti nentu Tamali. <verse eid="2SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 13:2" />Amunoni katabikiti nentu ata kulitenda kalwala toziya ya dada gwakuyi Tamali, Toziya Tamali kaweriti keneyalami. <verse eid="2SA 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 13:3" />Kumbiti Amunoni kaweriti na ganja yawamshemiti Yonadabu, mwana gwa Shama, mlongu gwa Dawudi. Yonadabu kaweriti muntu kana mahala nentu. <verse eid="2SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 13:4" />Yonadabu kamgambira Amunoni, “Gwenga ndo mwana gwa mfalumi, ntambu gaa guyonda na guwoneka gwahera nemeru kila lishaka. Mbona gufira ndiri kung'ambira?” Amunoni kamgambira,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:4">“Numfira Tamali, dada gwa mlongu gwangu Abisalomu.”<verse eid="2SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 13:5" />Yonadabu kamgambira, “Gugendi gwakagonji pashitanda pagulitenda kuwera gwamlweri. Tati gwaku pakiza kukulola, gwenga gumluwi pagulonga, gumleki dada gwangu Tamali kanjegili libumunda ndiyi na kantandiri shiboga kulongolu kwa neni su nishiwoni na yomberi kandiyiziyi.” <verse eid="2SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 13:6" />Hangu, Amunoni kendeleya kugonja pashitanda. Pakalitenda Kalwala.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:6">Mfalumi pakagenditi kumlola, Amunoni kamgambiti, “Nikuluwa, Tamali kizi panu kandandiri mabumunda madidi agawu panimlola. Shakapanu mweni kandiyiziyi.”<verse eid="2SA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 13:7" />Hangu, Dawudi kalagalira wantu kwa Tamari kuwera. “Kagendi ukaya kwa kaka gwakuyi Amunoni, kakamtandiri shiboga.” <verse eid="2SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 13:8" />Tamari kaweriti aku, kamwona Amunoni kagonja. Katola ubumu na kukabanga na kubanika mabumunda kulongolu kwa Amunoni. <verse eid="2SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 13:9" />Mabumunda aga pagaweriti kala, Tamali kagajobola kulawa kushijonju. Kamjegera Amunoni, kumbiti Amunoni kalemiti kuliya, “kalonga kila yumu na kalawi kunja na woseri wawuka.” <verse eid="2SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 13:10" />Shakapanu, Amunoni kamgambira Tamari, “vinu gunjegeri mabumunda aga kushumba kwa neni, shakapanu gundiyiziyi.” Tamari katoliti mabumunda gakatanditi na kugajega kushumba kwa kaka gwakuyi Amunoni. <verse eid="2SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 13:11" />Pakaweriti kankumpanana mabumunda aga, Amunoni kambatiti na kumgambira, “Gwizi gugonji na neni!”<verse eid="2SA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 13:12" />Tamari kamgambira, “Ndala kaka gwangu. Nagunkakanika Shitendu ashi shitendeka ndiri Muisraeli! Nagutenda shitendu ashi sha ungalimahala! <verse eid="2SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 13:13" />Hantuli koshi sheni shangu kwa soni ayi. Na gwenga, haguweri yumu gwa wangalimahala Muisraeli. Su neni nikuluwa guyoweri na mfalumi toziya hapeni kalemi kunyuga.” <verse eid="2SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 13:14" />Kumbiti Amunoni kafiliti ndiri kumpikinira na toziya kaweriti nalikakala kuliku yomberi kamkakanika kagonja nayu.<verse eid="2SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 13:15" />Shakapanu, Amunoni kamkalalira nentu Tamali. Kamkalalira Tamali kuliku ntambu yakamfiliti shaka shipititi. Kamgambira Tamari, “Guwuki kalongola!”<verse eid="2SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 13:16" />Tamari kamwankula, “Ndala kaka gwangu, likontola ali likulu lya kuwinga ndo lidoda nentu kuliku lilii lyaguntenderiti!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:16">Kumbiti Amunoni kafira ndiri kumpikinira. <verse eid="2SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 13:17" />Kamshema mntemba gwakuyi yakamtenderiti, kamgambira, “Gumlaviyi mdala ayu. Na gulitati ligomi.” <verse eid="2SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 13:18" />Amunoni na mntemba ulii wamlaviya kunja na kalitata ligomi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:18">Tamali kaweriti kavala nguwu ntali zyana mawoku matali hangu ndo ntambu yawavaliti wahinga wa mfalumi yawaweriti wenigonji na mpalu mashaka aga. <verse eid="2SA 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 13:19" />Su, Tamari kaswaga malivu kumtuyi, kaipapu nguwu yakuyi, kagatula mawoku gakuyi kumtuyi, shakapanu kawuka agawu pakalira kwa kubota. <verse eid="2SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 13:20" />Kaka gwakuyi, Abisalomu, pakamwoniti kamkosiya, “Hashi, Amunoni kaka gwaku kagonja na gwenga? Gunyamali dada gwangu. Yomberi ndo kaka gwaku. Nagushilekera shitwatira ashi mumoyu mwaku.” Hangu, Tamari kalikaliti mnumba ya Abisalomu pakawera na hinginika na mgweka.<verse eid="2SA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 13:21" />Mfalumi Dawudi pakapikiniriti shitwatira ashi kakalaliti nentu. <verse eid="2SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 13:22" />Abisalomu kamkalaliriti Amunoni nentu ata katakula nayu ndiri, toziya kamkola kwa likakala dada gwakuyi Tamari na kugonja nayu.<verse eid="2SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abisalomu kawuzilira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 13:23" />Vinja viwili pavipititi, Abisalomu kaweriti na lihengu lya kulikitula kondolu wakuyi mibahila kumji gwa Baala Hasoli, pakwegera na Efraimu. Kawashemera wana woseri wapalu wa mfalumi. <verse eid="2SA 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 13:24" />Abisalomu kamgendera mfalumi Dawudi, kamgambira, “Guloli, neni ntumintumi gwaku yaniwadumula kondolu mibahira. Nikuluwa gwenga mfalumi pamuhera na wantumintumi waku, mgendi pamuhera na neni, ntumintumii gwaku.”<verse eid="2SA 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 13:25" />Mfalumi kamwankula, “Ndala, mwana gwangu,” natugenda woseri, “Natwiza kuwera shisanka kwa gwenga.” Tembera Abisalomu kongera kumluwa tati gwakuyi kagendi, kumbiti mfalumi kalema, ila kampanana tekelera zakuyi.<verse eid="2SA 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 13:26" />Shakapanu Abisalomu kamgambira, “Handa gugenda ndiri, su, gumleki mlongu gwangu Amunoni tugendi nayu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:26">Mfalumi kamwankula, “Ntambu gaa kagendi pamuhera na mwenga?” <verse eid="2SA 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 13:27" />Kumbiti Abisalomu kongeriti kumluwa na upeleru mfalumi kamjimira Amunoni na wana wakuyi wamonga wagendi kumsambu agu. <verse eid="2SA 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 13:28" />Abisalomu kawagambira wantumintumi wakuyi, “Mumloreli Amunoni pakawera kalanda na kulowera, mumkomi Amunoni, mumlagi. Ali ndo lilagaliru lyangu kwa mwenga. Mliyupi moyu na muweri wagangamala.” <verse eid="2SA 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 13:29" />Hangu, wantumintumi wa Abisalomu wamtenderiti Amunoni ntambu yawagambiritwi na Abisalomu, shakapanu wana wapalu wamonga wa mfalumi wawuka kila yumu kakwena punda farasi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Litawu punda farasi lilawirana na kanyama Nyumbu</char></note> gwakuyi na kutuga.<verse eid="2SA 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 13:30" />Pawaweriti mnjira, Dawudi kapatiti visoweru kuwera, “Wana wakuyi woseri walaguwa na Abisalomu na kwahera ata yumu yakasigaliti!” <verse eid="2SA 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 13:31" />Mfalumi Dawudi kagolokiti, kapapula nguwu zakuyi kwa hinginika kagonja pasi. Ata na wantumintumi wakuyi woseri waweriti wagoloka pakwegera na yomberi wapapuliti nguwu zawu. <verse eid="2SA 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 13:32" />Kumbiti Yonadabu, mwana gwa Shimea, mlongu gwa Dawudi kamgambira, “Mtuwa gwangu, nagulihola kuwera wana waku woseri walaguwa. Amunoni gweka yakuyi ndo yakalaguwitwi. Aga Abisalomi kagapangiti kala kugatenda kwanjira shaka Amunoni pakambatiti kwa likakala dada gwakuyi Tamali na kugonja nayu. <verse eid="2SA 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 13:33" />Hangu, mtuwa gwangu, nagulihola mmoyu mwaku handa wana waku woseri wahowa. Amunoni gweka yakuyi ndo yakalagitwi.”<verse eid="2SA 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 13:34" />Kumbiti Abisalomu kaweriti katugiti kala.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:34">Katepu mntemba yakaweriti kamuulolera, kawona shipinga shikulu sha wantu pawiza kulawa kulugongu munjira ya Horonaimu. <verse eid="2SA 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 13:35" />Yonadabu kamgambira Dawudi, “Guloli mfalumi, wana waku wakwiza ntambu yanikugambiriti neni ntumintumi gwaku.” <verse eid="2SA 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 13:36" />Katepu hera ntumintumi pakamaliliti kulonga, wana wapalu wa Mfalumi na wantumintumi wakuyi woseri, wanja kulira kwa kubotanga. Mfalumi na wantumintumi wakuyi woseri walira kwa hinginika.<verse eid="2SA 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 13:37" />Kumbiti Abisalomu katugiliti kwa Talimai mwana gwa Amihudi, mfalumi gwa mji gwa Geshuri. Mfalumi Dawudi kadaya toziya ya mwana gwakuyi Amunoni kwa mashaka gavuwa. <verse eid="2SA 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 13:38" />Abisalomu katugiliti mji gwa Geshuri, kalikala aku kwa shaka sha vinja vitatu. <verse eid="2SA 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 13:39" />Mfalumi Dawudi pakamaliliti kudaya kuhowa kwa mwana gwakuyi Amunoni, kafiliti kumwona mwana gwakuyi Abisalomu.<verse eid="2SA 13:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2SA 14" />
  <para style="s">Yoabu kankupanga kumwuziya Abisalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 14:1" />Yoabu mwana gwa Seruya, kavimaniti handa mfalumi kaweriti kamhola nentu na kafiliti kumlola mwana gwakuyi Abisalomu. <verse eid="2SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 14:2" />Hangu kawalagalila wantu aku Tekoa su wakamjegi mdala kana luhala. Pawamjegiti, kamgambira, “Gulipayiri gwankugonjera shiwembu. Guvali nguwu za kudaya, naguliswagi lipaki na gulitendi handa mdala yakawera mukudaya toziya ya wahowiti kwa shaka shitali. <verse eid="2SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 14:3" />Shakapanu gugendi kwa Mfalumi gumgambiri galii ganikugambira.” Yoabu kamgambira visoweru vya kumgambira mfalumi.<verse eid="2SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 14:4" />Mdala ayu kulawa Tekoa kagenda kwa mfalumi, kaguwa makukama, kulongolu kwa mfalumi, kamsundamalira, kamgambira, “Gwee mfalumi, guntangi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 14:5" />Mfalumi kamkosiya, “Gufira shishi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:5">Mdala ulii kamwankula, “Neni ndo namkenja, mpalu gwangu kahowa. <verse eid="2SA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 14:6" />Weriti na wana wapalu wawili. Lishaka limu, pawaweriti kushiwala, wanjiti kulikomanga toziya kuweriti ndiri na muntu yoseri gwa kuwakamlira, yumu gwawu kamlaga myaguwi. <verse eid="2SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 14:7" />Vinu walongu wangu woseri wang'alambuka neni ntumintumi gwaku, wafira nimlavii kwa womberi mwana yakamlagiti myaguwi su wamlagi toziya kamlagiti mlongu gwakuyi. Hangu, hawamlagi ayu mweni vinu ndo mhala gwangu. Pawatenda hangu, hawaliwusiyi nakamu litumbiru lyangu lyalisigaliti na mpalu gwangu hapeni kalekelwi litawu pota mwiwuka kuisi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 14:8" />Mfalumi kamgambira mdala ulii, “Guwuyi ukaya handagaliri shitwatira shaku shilolwi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 14:9" />Mdala kulawa Tekoa kalonga, “Mtuwa gwangu mfalumi, handa payilawira ntabiku yoseri ilii hayiweri kwaneni na walongu wa tati gwangu.”<verse eid="2SA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 14:10" />Mfalumi kamgambira, “Muntu yoseri yakanakutabisiyi gumjegi kwa neni na hapeni kizi kukushinkula kayi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 14:11" />Mdala ulii kamgambira, “Shondi, mfalumi, gunduwiri kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku, su kumbeziyi mlongu gwangu ulii yakafila kumlaga mwana gwangu nakatenda shidoda shimonga shikulu sha kumlaga mwana gwangu yumonga.” Mfalumi Dawudi kamgambira,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:11">“Ntambu yakalikala Mtuwa Mlungu, mwana gwaku hapeni katenduwi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 14:12" />Mdala ulii kamgambira, “Nikuluwa, neni ntumintumi gwaku, gunjimili ntakuli shisoweru shimu kwa gwenga mfalumi.” Mfalumi kamgambira,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:12">“Gulongi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 14:13" />Mdala ulii kamgambira, “Ntambu gaa, gupanga ukondola awu kwa wantu wa Mlungu? Gumlekiziya ndiri mwana gwaku kawuyi ukaya kulawa kwakatugiriti, vinu gulitoza gamweni kwa aga gagulongiti. <verse eid="2SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 14:14" />Twenga handa mashi yagitikiti pasi geni gajoleka ndiri, twawoseri hatuhowi. Ata Mlungu kawawuziya ndiri yakahowiti waweri wakomu, kumbiti mfalumi kaweza kusakula njira ya kuwuziya muntu yakatugira kuisi ya shihenga. <verse eid="2SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 14:15" />Niza kuyowera na gwenga, mtuwa gwangu mfalumi, toziya wantu wantiriziya. Su, neni ntumintumi gwaku, nilihola kuwera, hanyoweri na mfalumi, pamonga hakawezi kuntendera vyanfira neni ntumintumi gwakuyi. <verse eid="2SA 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 14:16" />Toziya mfalumi hakapikinili na kunopola mmawoku mwa muntu yakafira kundaga neni pamuhera na mwana gwangu kulawa uhala wa Mlungu. <verse eid="2SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 14:17" />Neni ntumintumi gwaku niliholiti handa, shisoweru sha mtuwa gwangu mfalumi hashinupi ponga mumoyu, toziya gwenga mtuwa gwangu mfalumi ndo handa ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mlungu mukugatula gweka maheri na madoda. Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku, kaweri pamuhera na gwenga!”<verse eid="2SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 14:18" />Mfalumi ndo pakamwankuliti mdala ulii, “Nagunfifa shisoweru shoseri shanfira kukukosiya.” Mdala ulii kalonga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:18">“Gulongi mtuwa gwangu mfalumi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 14:19" />Mfalumi kamkosiya, “Hashi, Yoabu kamushitwatira ashi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:19">Mdala ulii kalonga, “Ntambu yagwendeleya kulikala, mtuwa gwangu mfalumi, kwahera muntu yakagalambukila kumshigi ama kumlihu mushitwatira ashi shagulongiti mtuwa gwangu mfalumi. Ntumintumi gwaku Yoabu ndo yakantumiti. Ganikugambiriti neni ntumintumi gwaku. <verse eid="2SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 14:20" />Yoabu kaweza kutenda mirandu ayi kuwera. Kumbiti, gwenga mtuwa gwangu gwana luhala handa lwa ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mlungu, ata guweza kuvimana vitwatira vyoseri vyaviwera kuisi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 14:21" />Mfalumi kamgambira Yoabu, “Vinu gupikinili, nfira gutendi ashi gugendi gwakamwuziyi ukaya mntemba Abisalomu.”<verse eid="2SA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 14:22" />Yoabu kaguwiti pasi makukama na kasuntamala na kumfilira mfalumi tekelera, kalonga, “Leru, neni ntumintumi gwaku, mtuwa gwangu mfalumi, nivimana kuwera gukujimira kuluwa kwa neni na hangu gunemiziwa na neni.” <verse eid="2SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 14:23" />Shakapanu, Yoabu kawuka kagenda Geshuri kumjega Abisalomu kumji gwa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 14:24" />Kumbiti mfalumi kalonga, “Abisalomu kalikali kutali na neni, kalikali ukaya kwakuyi. Nakiza panu kundola.” Hangu, Abisalomu kagenda kankulikala kutali na neni, kalikali ukaya kwakuyi.<verse eid="2SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abisalomu na mfalumi Dawudi wankupatana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 14:25" />Muisraeli yoseri, kwahera yoseri yakaherepa handa Abisalomu. Kwanjira lwayu lwakuyi mpaka kulutosi lwakuyi, Abisalomi kaweriti ndiri na shilema. <verse eid="2SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 14:26" />Kaweriti na viri zivuwa na kazimogiti mala yimu kila shinja toziya mweni kaziwona kuwera ntali na zizotopa, pakazimoga uzotopa wakuyi uweriti handa kilu mbili kwakulinganira na vipimu ntambu yavitulitwi na ufalumi. <verse eid="2SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 14:27" />Abisalomu kaleriti wana watatu wapalu pamuhera na mhinga yumu litawu lyakuyi Tamali, Tamali kaweriti mdala kaherepa.<verse eid="2SA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 14:28" />Su, Abisalomu kalikaliti kumji gwa Yerusalemu kwa shaka sha vinja viwili vyoseri pota kumlola mfalumi Dawudi. <verse eid="2SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 14:29" />Shakapanu, Abisalomu kamshema Yoabu, su kamlagaliri kwa mfalumi, kumbiti Yoabu kalema, Abisalomu kamshema kayi kumbiti Yoabu kalema. <verse eid="2SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 14:30" />Su Abisalomu kawagambira wantumintumi wakuyi, “Mloli Yoabu kana lilambu lya shayili pakwegera na lyangu. Mgendi mkalipambi motu.” Hangu wantumintumi wa Abisalomu walipamba motu lilambu lya Yoabu.<verse eid="2SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 14:31" />Yoabu kagenda ukaya kwa Abisalomu kamkosiya, “Ntambu gaa wantumintumi waku wapamba motu lilambu lyangu?”<verse eid="2SA 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 14:32" />Abisalomu kamwankula, “Guloli, Nikujegiriti ulagilagi, gwizi agawu su nikulagalili kwa mfalumi, gwakamukosiyi, ntambu gaa mbukiti Geshuri? Meyiweri mbaka kusigala aku.” Vinu guntangi mpati kumlola mfalumi, “Handa nana likondola su kandagi!”<verse eid="2SA 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 14:33" />Hangu Yoabu kagenda na kumgambira mfalumi visoweru avi vyoseri na mfalumi kamshema Abisalomu na kingira kwa mfalumi kaguwa makukama kulongolu kwa mfalumi na mfalumi kamkisikila Abisalomu.<verse eid="2SA 14:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2SA 15" />
  <para style="s">Abisalomu kapanga kugalambuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 15:1" />Palilawiru ali, Abisalomu kalipananiti mbutuka za kukwega na farasi na farasi na wantu hamsini wa kumlongolera. <verse eid="2SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 15:2" />Abisalomu kazoweleriti kwimuka mandawira putiputi na kugenda kugoloka kunjira yaigenda kuligomi likulu lya mji. Muntu yoseri yakaweriti na ndewu kafiliti kuyijega kwa mfalumi su kapati utanga wakuyi, Abisalomu kamshema muntu ayu kumbwega na kumkosiya, “Gulawa mji gaa?” Handa muntu ayu pakalonga kalawa mji tunga gwa likabila lwa Israeli, <verse eid="2SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 15:3" />Abisalomu kamgambira, “Ndewu yaku ndo yanakaka. Kumbiti kwahera yakasyagulitwi na mfalumi kukupikinira.” <verse eid="2SA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 15:4" />Kayi, Abisalomu kamgambira, “Meweri mtoza gwa Israeli! Kila muntu kana ndewu ama shisoweru mekizi kwaneni na menimtenderi ntambu yayifiruwa.” <verse eid="2SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 15:5" />Muntu yoseri yakiza kwa Abisalomu na kumsuntamalira kwa ligoya yomberi katalipisiya liwoku na kumkola na kumkisikila. <verse eid="2SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 15:6" />Hangu Abisalomu ntambu yakawatenderiti Waisraeli woseri yawiziti kusakula utanga kwa mfalumi. Kwa kutenda hangu, Abisalomu kafiritwi na Waisraeli.<verse eid="2SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 15:7" />Pavipititi vinja vyamsheshi, Abisalomu kamgambira mfalumi, “Shondi gunjimiri ng'endi aku Hebroni su kuwusiya nazili yanimtuliliti Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 15:8" />Toziya, neni ntumintumi gwaku, panilikaliti Geshuri muisi ya Aramu, nimtuliliti Mlungu nazili panonga kuwera handa Mlungu pakambuziya kumji gwa Yerusalemu, hanimguwiri yomberi.”<verse eid="2SA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 15:9" />Mfalumi kamgambira, “su, gugendi kwa ponga.” Abisalomu kawuka kugenda Hebroni. <verse eid="2SA 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 15:10" />Kumbiti Abisalomu kawalagaliliti walagilagi kwa bada mumakabila goseri ga Israeli, pakalonga, “Pampikanila liziwu lya lipenka, mlongi, Abisalomu ndo mfalumi gwa Hebroni!” <verse eid="2SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 15:11" />Abisalomu kagenditi aku Hebroni, kagenditi na wantu miya mbili yakawashemiliti aku kwa moyu gumu, wavimaniti ndiri shoseri shilii shakafiliti kutenda Abisalomu. <verse eid="2SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 15:12" />Shaka Abisalomu pakaweriti kankulaviya tambiku, kalagalila ulagilagi kumji gwa Gilo kumshema Ahitofeli muntu gwa Gilo, yakaweriti muntu gwa pakwegera gwa mfalumi Dawudi. Ugalambuka wa Abisalomu wongerekiti kupata likakala na wantu yawamfatiti wongerekiti.<verse eid="2SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Dawudi kankutuga Yerusalemu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 15:13" />Mlagilagi tunga pakamgenderiti Dawudi na kumgambira, “Wantu wa Israeli wapamuhera na Abisalomu.”<verse eid="2SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 15:14" />Su, Dawudi kawagambira wantumintumi wakuyi yakaweriti nawa kumji gwa Yerusalemu, “Mgoloki tutugi, hera hangu, hapeni tuwezi kumshapira Abisalomu! Tutendi kalongola kuwuka! Nakiza kutujegera madoda na kuguhalibisiya mji kwa nkondu!”<verse eid="2SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 15:15" />Kumbiti wantumintumi wakuyi wamgambira, “Twenga wantumintumi waku, mtuwa gwetu mfalumi, twakala kutenda shoseri shagutugambira.” <verse eid="2SA 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 15:16" />Su, mfalumi kawuka pamuhera na walongu wakuyi, kumbiti kawaleka wadala wakuyi wa kunja lilongu pawatenda lihengu lya ukaya.<verse eid="2SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 15:17" />Mfalumi kawuka pamuhera na wantu wakuyi woseri, kumbiti pawasokiti panumba ya upeleru wa mji woyera shididini. <verse eid="2SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 15:18" />Wantumintumi woseri wa mfalumi na Wakereti woseri na Wapereti woseri, pamuhera na Wagiti miya sita yawamfatiti mfalumi Dawudi kulawa mji gwa Gati, wawukiti pamuhera na yomberi pawamlongolera.<verse eid="2SA 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 15:19" />Shakapanu, mfalumi Dawudi pakamwoniti Itai muntu gwa Giti, kamgambira, “Ntambu gaa ata gwenga gwankuwuka pamuhera na twenga? Guwuyi gwankalikali na mfalumi ayu Abusolumu. Toziya gwenga ndo mhenga aku, kayi ndo mtuga isi kulawa ukaya kwenu. <verse eid="2SA 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 15:20" />Gwiziti aku mashanashana hera. Hashi, nikutendi muntu gwa kuyerayera pamuhera na twenga, aku neni nivimana ndiri ata kwa ng'enda? Guwuyi ukaya pamuhera na walongu waku. Mtuwa Mlungu hakakulanguziyi uheri wakuyi na waminika wakuyi.”<verse eid="2SA 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 15:21" />Kumbiti Itai kamwankula mfalumi, “Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakalikala, poseri paguwera, payiwera kwa kuhowa ama kwa kulikala na neni ntumintumi gwaku haweri.”<verse eid="2SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 15:22" />Su, Dawudi kamgambira Itai, “Gugendi kulongolu.” Hangu, Itai muntu gwa Giti, kapita mweni pamuhera na wana wakuyi. <verse eid="2SA 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 15:23" />Dawudi pakaweriti kankupita pamuhera na wantu wakuyi, wantu woseri kuisi yoseri waliliti kwa kubotanga. Mfalumi Dawudi kaloka lushemba lwa Kidironi pamuhera na wantu woseri wagenda kushiwala.<verse eid="2SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 15:24" />Mtambika Abiyatali kalawa na mtambika Sadoki kalawa pamuhera na Walawi woseri agawu pawajega lisandiku lya lipatanu lya Mlungu, mpaka wantu woseri pawapititi kulawa mji gwa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 15:25" />Shakapanu mfalumi kamgambira Sadoki, “Guwuziyi lisandiku lya patanu lya Mlungu kumji gwa Yerusalemu. Handa panjimilwa kulongolu kwa Mlungu, su hakambuziyi na kunupa kuliwona kayi lisandiku lyakuyi na kuliwona kayi pahala pakuyi palitulwa. <verse eid="2SA 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 15:26" />Handa Mlungu kafiliziwa ndiri na neni, su neni na kala kantenderi shoseri shakafira.” <verse eid="2SA 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 15:27" />Mfalumi Dawudi kamgambira kayi Sadoki, “Guloli, gumtoli mwana gwa Ahimaasi na Yonatani mwana gwa Abiatali muuyi kwa ponga. <verse eid="2SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 15:28" />Hanikuheperi kundanganu aku kushidowu, mpaka pampata visoweru kulawa kwa gwenga.” <verse eid="2SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 15:29" />Hangu Sadoki na Abiyatali wawuziya lisandiku lwa Patanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu kumji gwa Yerusalemu na womberi wasigala aku.<verse eid="2SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 15:30" />Kumbiti Dawudi kendereyiti, kakwena kulugongu lwa Mizeyituni agawu pakalira, pota kuvala vilwatu na mtuyi yakuyi igubikirwa. Wantu woseri yawaweriti pamuhera na yomberi wayigibikiriti mituwi yawu pawawera wankukwena lugongu agawu pawalira. <verse eid="2SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 15:31" />Shaka ashi, Dawudi kagambiritwi kuwera Ahitofeli kaweriti yumu gwa yawamgalambuka yawaweriti pamuhera na Abisalomu. Hangu Dawudi kaluwa pakalonga, “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu nikuluwa, shakafira kutenda Ahitoferi shisindi.”<verse eid="2SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 15:32" />Dawudi pakasokiti kulupeleru lwa lugongu, pahala pa kumguwira Mlungu, muntu yumu litawu lyakuyi Hushayi kulawa Ariki kiziti su kumwanka, nguwu yakuyi payiwera ipapuka na pamtuwi pakuyi kalitula madikudiku. <verse eid="2SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 15:33" />Dawudi kamgambira, “Pagugenda pamuhera na neni, haguweri handa shisanka kwa neni. <verse eid="2SA 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 15:34" />Kumbiti handa haguwuyi kumji gwa Yerusalemu na kumgambira Abisalomu, haweri ntumintumi gwaku, gwee mfalumi, ntambu yakaweriti ntumintumi gwa tati gwaku, mashaka gapititi, su, haguweri guntanga kwa galii gakafira kundendera Ahitoferi. <verse eid="2SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 15:35" />Watambika Sadoki na Abiatali wa pamuhera na gwenga kumji, su shoseri shagupikinira kulawa ukaya kwa mfalumi guwagambiri watambika awa. <verse eid="2SA 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 15:36" />Guloli, wana wawili wapalu, Ahimaasi mwana gwa Sadoki na Yotani mwana gwa Abiyatali wa pamuhera na womberi. Na shoseri shampikinira hamnjegeri visoweru kupitila womberi.”<verse eid="2SA 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 15:37" />Su, Hushayi ganja gwa mfalumi Dawudi, kawuya mjini na shaka shiraashi Abisalomu kaweriti kakwingira kumji gwa Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 15:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2SA 16" />
  <para style="s">Dawudi na Ziba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 16:1" />Dawudi pakaweriti kapita patali shididini upeleru wa lugongu, Siba ntumintumi gwa Mefibosheti kamwankiti Dawudi pakawera na punda wawili weni waweriti wapapa mabumunda miya mbili na visana miya yimu vya zabibu iyuma na mabwajubwaju gawula na shihaku sha likuli shashimemiti divayi. <verse eid="2SA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 16:2" />Mfalumi Dawudi kamkosiya Siba, “Ntambu gaa gujega vintu avi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:2">Siba kamwankula, “Punda toziya ya kukwena wantu wa kaya yaku, mabumunda na mabwajubwaju toziya ya wantemba woseri na divai toziya yawafila kutoka kushiwala.”<verse eid="2SA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 16:3" />Mfalumi kamkosiya, “Mwana gwa mtuwa gwaku kakoshi?” Siba kamgambira mfalumi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:3">“Yomberi kasigala kumji gwa Yerusalemu,” Siba kankula, “Toziya kalihora handa wantu wa Israeli hawamwuziliri ufalumi wa Sauli mbuyi gwakuyi.”<verse eid="2SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 16:4" />Mfalumi kamgambira Siba, “Su, kila shintu shakaweriti nashi Mefibosheti vinu ndo shaku.” Siba kamwankula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:4">“Mayagashii, mtuwa gwangu mfalumi na neni nduwa mpati kujimilika kulongolu kwaku mashaka goseri!”<verse eid="2SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shimeyi kankumpangira Dawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 16:5" />Mfalumi Dawudi pakasokiti kulii Bahurimu, kalawiliti muntu yumu gwa lukolu lwa Sauli, litawu lyakuyi Shimeyi mwana gwa Gera, kanja kumpangira Dawudi. <verse eid="2SA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 16:6" />Kawera kankumgumira mabuwi mfalumi Dawudi pamuhera na wantumintumi wakuyi. Wantu wamonga woseri na wamashonta pawawera wankumzyengeta Dawudi uwega wa kumliwu na kumshigi. <verse eid="2SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 16:7" />Shimeyi kampangiriti Dawudi pakalonga, “Guwuki! Guwuki! Gwenga muntu yagulaga! Gwenga muntu ndiri! <verse eid="2SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 16:8" />Mtuwa Mlungu kakuwuzililira kwa kwita mwazi gwa wantu woseri wa kaya ya Sauli, vinu Mtuwa Mlungu kampanana ufalumi Abisalomu mwana gwaku.Guloli, makomangu hagakupati toziya gwenga ndo mlaga.”<verse eid="2SA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 16:9" />Hangu Abishai mwana gwa Seruya, kamgambira mfalumi, “Ntambu gaa ng'ang'a ayu kafuwa kakupangiri gwenga mtuwa gwangu mfalumi? Gunjimiri nimgenderi na kumlikitula mtuwi gwakuyi!”<verse eid="2SA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 16:10" />Kumbiti mfalumi kamgambira, “Hashi, kwana shishi pakati pangu na mwenga wana wa Seruya,? Payiwera Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira kampangiri Dawudi, gaa vinu kaweza kukosiya, iwera hashi gutenda hangu?” <verse eid="2SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 16:11" />Kayi mfalumi Dawudi kamgambira Abishai na wantumintumi wakuyi woseri, “Payiwera mwana gwangu namweni kafira kundaga, hashi nentu ndiri kwa muntu gwa likabila lya benjamini? Mwenga mumleki kampangiri toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kamlagalira kampangiri neni. <verse eid="2SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 16:12" />Pamonga Mtuwa Mlungu kalola ntabiku yangu na yomberi kandipa uheri kwa pangira ayi yampata leru.” <verse eid="2SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 16:13" />Hangu mfalumi Dawudi na wantu wakuyi wendereya na mwanja aku Shimeyi kawera kankumfata pakamwasira mabuwi na kumutimulila madikudiku mfalumi Dawudi. Shimeyi kaweriti kakutyanga kulugongu, pakalolana na mfalumi Dawudi. <verse eid="2SA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 16:14" />Shakapanu mfalumi pamuhera na wantu woseri yawaweriti na yomberi, wasokiti kulushemba Yoridani pawawera watoka, su woyera.<verse eid="2SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abisalomu kumji gwa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 16:15" />Shaka ashi, Abisalomu na wantu woseri wa Israeli, wagenda kumji gwa Yerusalemu na Ahitoferi kaweriti pamuhera na womberi. <verse eid="2SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 16:16" />Hushayi kulawa Ariki, ganja gwa Dawudi, kamgendera Abisalomu, kamgambira, “Gulikali mashaka gavuwa mfalumi! Gulikali mashaka gavuwa mfalumi!”<verse eid="2SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 16:17" />Abisalomu kamkosiya Hushayi, “Hashi, awu ndo ufiru waku kwa ganja gwaku Dawudi? Ntambu gaa gugenda ndiri pamuhera na ganja gwaku?”<verse eid="2SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 16:18" />Hushayi kamwankula, “Ndala! Toziya ulii yakasyagulwa na Mtuwa Mlungu na wantu awa na wantu woseri wa Israeli, ayu ndo yansigali nayu. <verse eid="2SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 16:19" />Nentu ya aga, hashi, hanimtenderi gaa? Hashi, mwana ndiri gwa ganja gwangu? Su, ntambu yanimtenderiti tati gwaku, viraa hanikutendera gwenga.”<verse eid="2SA 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 16:20" />Abisalomu ndo pakamgambiriti Ahitofeli, “Gung'ambiziyi shakutenda, tutendi hashi?”<verse eid="2SA 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 16:21" />Ahitofeli kamgambira Abisalomu, “Guwagonji wadala wa kunja wa tati gwaku weni kawalekiti kulolera numba yakuyi. Shakapanu wantu woseri wa Israeli pawapikinira handa gulitenda gukalalirwi na tati gwaku, panu wantu woseri yawaweriti pamuhera na gwenga hawapananwi likakala.” <verse eid="2SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 16:22" />Hangu, wantu wamnyawira Abisalomu liringu kushitwiku na yomberi kagonja na wadala wa kunja wa tati gwakuyi na wantu woseri wa Israeli pawawera wankumlola.<verse eid="2SA 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 16:23" />Mashaka aga, litakulu lyoseri lyakalaviyiti Ahitofeli liweriti handa lilaviwa na Mlungu. Na litakulu lyakalaviyiti Ahitofeli lipananitwi ligoya na Dawudi na Abisalomu.<verse eid="2SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2SA 17" />
  <para style="s">Hushayi kankumpotoziya Abisalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 17:1" />Nentu ya aga, Ahitofoli kamgambiriti Abisalomu, “Gunjimili syaguli wantu elufu lilongu na mbili, mbuki na kumgendera Dawudi leru pashiru. <verse eid="2SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 17:2" />Hanimkomangi pakawera katoka na kutwezuka na neni hanimpanani lyoga. Wantu woseri yawawera pamuhera na yomberi hawatiri. Hanimlagi mfalumi gweka yakuyi, <verse eid="2SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 17:3" />na kuwawuziya wantu woseri kwa gwenga handa mdala gwa ndowa ntambu yakawuya ukaya kwa mpalu gwakuyi. Gwenga gugasakula makaliru ga muntu yumu hera na wantu wamonga hawaweri na ponga.” <verse eid="2SA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 17:4" />Mpangu agu gwa Ahitofeli gumfiliziyiti Abisalomu na wazewi woseri wa Israeli.<verse eid="2SA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 17:5" />Shakapanu, Abisalomu kalonga, “Mmushemi viraa Hushayi, muntu ulii gwa Ariki, tupikiniri lyakafira kulonga.” <verse eid="2SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 17:6" />Hushayi pakasokiti kwa Abisalomu, Abisalomu kamkosiyiti, “Hangu ndo ntambu yakatakuliti Ahitoferi. Hashi, tutendi ntambu yakatugambiriti? Handa ndala, gutugambiri lya kutenda.”<verse eid="2SA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 17:7" />Hushayi kamgambira Abisalomu, “Litakulu lyakalilaviyiti Ahitofeli shaka ashi shiherepa ndiri. <verse eid="2SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 17:8" />Nentu ya aga, Hushayi kamgambira, gwenga guvimana handa tati gwaku na wantu wakuyi ndo wagangamala wa nkondu na handa wakalaziwa handa simba shidala yakapokitwi wana wakuyi kushiwala. Vilavilii, guvimana tati gwaku ndo muntu gwa nkondu. Yomberi hapakagonji pashiru poseri pamuhera na wantu wakuyi. <verse eid="2SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 17:9" />Ata vinu kalififa kala mugamu ga mpanga yagawera aku ama pahala pamonga, handa pakanja kuvikomanga vipinga vyaku, muntu yoseri yakapikanila visoweru avi hakalongi, wantu wa Abisalomu hawaweri wasinda. <verse eid="2SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 17:10" />Wantu waku yawawera na miyoyu handa simba, hawatwezuki na kuwuya kumbeli kwa lyoga. Toziya, Waisraeli woseri wavimana kuwera tati gwaku ndo mgangamala na woseri yawawera pamuhera na yomberi ndo wantu wagangamala. <verse eid="2SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 17:11" />Shantakula neni ndo ashi, guwajojoniri kwaku gwenga wantu woseri wa Israeli kwanjira Dani yayiwera uwega wa kusika mpaka Beeri Sheba uwega wa kushana, waweri wavuwa handa mhanga gwa bahari na gwenga gugendi kunkondu. <verse eid="2SA 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 17:12" />Na twenga hatumsakuli Dawudi pahala poseri pakaweza kuwoneka na hatumkankali handa mangami yagatulukira pasi. Su, kwahera yanakasigala, mekaweri mweni ama wantu wakuyi woseri yawawera pamuhera na yomberi. <verse eid="2SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 17:13" />Payiwera hakatugiri kumji tunga, su, wantu woseri wa Israeli hawajegi lugoyi na kugukwega mji agu, mpaka kululalanda, nashisigala shoseri ata libuwi lididini lya mji agu.”<verse eid="2SA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 17:14" />Abisalomu pamuhera na wantu woseri wa Israeli walonga, “Litakulu lya Hushayi ndo liherepa nentu kuliku litakulu lya Ahitofeli.” Walemiti litakulu liherepa lya Ahitofeli, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kapangiti kulitenda litakulu liheri lya Ahitoferi nalitendwa su kawezi kumjegera Abisalomu vidoda.<verse eid="2SA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dawudi kankuberiziwa na kutoloka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 17:15" />“Shakapanu Hushayi kawagambira watambika Sadoki na Abiatali, Ahitofeli na neni ntambu yatuwagambiriti Abisalomu na wazewi wa Israeli.” <verse eid="2SA 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 17:16" />Kawagambira wamjegeri Dawudi visoweru kalong'ola nagugonja ndang'anu kushiwala, “Su, katendi kalongola, kuloka lushemba na kuwuka su nakiza kubatwa na kulaguwa, yomberi pamuhera na wantu wakuyi woseri.”<verse eid="2SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 17:17" />Yonatani na Ahimaasi, waweriti warififa aku pakwegera na Eni Rogeli, su nawawoneka na muntu yoseri pawingira mjini. Kila mala mdala tunga kaweriti kankuwajegera visoweru vyavilawiriti na womberi wavijega kwa mfalumi Dawudi. <verse eid="2SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 17:18" />Kumbiti shaka ashi, wawonekaniti na mntemba yumu mweni kagenditi na kumgambira Abisalomu. Hangu, Yonatani na Ahimaasi wawukiti kalongola, wagenda Bahurimu ukaya kwa muntu tunga yakaweriti na linegu lyaliweriti kuzyetu kwakuyi. Wingira amu kulinegu na kulififa. <verse eid="2SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 17:19" />Mdala kana numba ayi katola shigibikiru na kugibikira linegu ali, shakapanu kandikira viboga pampindi pa shigibikiru. Kwahera muntu yakavimaniti mlandu agu. <verse eid="2SA 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 17:20" />Wamashonta wa Abisalomu pawasokiti kwa madala ayu, wamgambira,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">“Wakoshi Ahimaasi na Yonatani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">Mdala ulii kawagambira, “Wagenda kumwambu kushishemba.” Pawawasakuliti woneka ndiri, wawuya ukaya kumji gwa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 17:21" />Pawawukiti kala wamashonta wa Abisalomu, Yonatani na Ahimaasi wawukiti kulinegu, wagenda kwa mfalumi Dawudi na kumgambira visoweru avi. Wamgambira, “Guwuki, gugendi kumwambu kushishemba, toziya Ahitofeli kamgambira Abisalomu mpangu gwa kukwizira gwenga.” <verse eid="2SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 17:22" />Hangu, Dawudi kawuka na wantu woseri yawaweriti pamuhera na yomberi, waloka lushemba lwa Yoridani. Payisokiti mandawira kwahera muntu yakasigaliti kumbeli pota kuloka lushemba lwa Yoridani.<verse eid="2SA 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 17:23" />Ahitofeli pakawoniti handa lyakatakuliti walifata ndiri, kamtanda punda gwakuyi, kagenda ukaya, Pakasokiti aku katuliti weri vitwatira vya numba yakuyi, kalikongera mweni na kahowa, kafintirwa kulisembi lya tati gwakuyi.<verse eid="2SA 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 17:24" />Su, Dawudi kagenda Mahanaimu. Abisalomu kaloka lushemba lwa Yoridani na wamashonta woseri wa Israeli. <verse eid="2SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 17:25" />Shaka ashi, Abisalomu kamtula Amasa kuwera mkulu gwa lishonta pahala pa Yoabu. Amasa kaweriti mwana gwa Yitira muntu gwa likabila lya Ishimaeli. Mawu gwakuyi wamshemiti Abigaili mhinga gwa Nahashi, yakaweriti dada gwakuyi Seruya, mawu gwakuyi kaweriti Yoabu. <verse eid="2SA 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 17:26" />Abisalomu pamuhera na wamashonta wa Israeli watuliti ng'onjeru yawu muisi ya Gileadi.<verse eid="2SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 17:27" />Dawudi pakasokiti Mahanaimu, Shobi mwana gwa Nahashi kulawa Amoni, Shobi mwana gwa Nahashi kulawa mji gwa Laba kulawa isi ya Amoni na Makili mwana gwa Amieli kulawa mji gwa Lodebari, pamuhera na Barizilai muntu gwa likabila lya Gileadi kulawa mji gwa Rogelimu, <verse eid="2SA 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 17:28" />Wajegiti ulili na mabakuli na vyombu vya utapaka na viravilii nganu na shayiri na ubumu na ntutu na mpangi na dengu. <verse eid="2SA 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 17:29" />Lwashi na kondolu na lipaki lyalilawa mumaweri ga ng'ombe wawu, wamjegera Dawudi pamuhera na wantu yakaweriti nawa. Toziya walongiti, “Wantu awa wana njala, watoka na wayumluwa mumwanja kushiwala.”<verse eid="2SA 17:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2SA 18" />
  <para style="s">Abisalomu kankusinda na kulaguwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 18:1" />Mfalumi Dawudi kawawalangiti wantu yawaweriti pamuhera na yomberi, kawabagula muvipinga vya maelufu pasi pa wakulu wawu na vipinga vya mamiya na pasi pa wakulu wawu. <verse eid="2SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 18:2" />Dawudi kalilagalira lishonta lyakuyi kunkondu mvipinga vitatu. Shipinga shimu shilonguziwa na Yoabu, shipinga sha pili shilonguziwa na Abishai mwana gwa Seruya, mlongu gwa Yoabu na shipinga sha tatu pasi pa Itai muntu gwa Giti. Shakapanu Dawudi kawagambira woseri, “Neni namweni hang'endi pamuhera na mwenga.”<verse eid="2SA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 18:3" />Kumbiti wamashonta wamgambira, “Hapeni gulawi, payiwera hatutugi hapeni watufati twenga. Payiwera nusu ya twenga hawahowi viraa hapeni walitendiziyi kwa twenga. Kumbiti gwenga gwana mana kuliku wantu elufu lilongu muwamu mwetu. Hangu gwenga gusigali mjini na kutujegera utanga paguwera mjini.”<verse eid="2SA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 18:4" />Mfalumi kawagambira, “Lyoseri lyamliwona ndo liherepa kwa mwenga, hanilitendi.” Hangu, mfalumi kagoloka kumbwega kuligomi likulu, aku lishonta lyakuyi palipita. Vipinga vya mamiya na maelufu. <verse eid="2SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 18:5" />Mfalumi kawalagalira Yoabu na Abishai na Itai, “Toziya ya neni, mmutenderi mntemba ulii Absalomu kwa upoli.” Wamashonta woseri wampikinira mfalumi pakawagambiliti wakulu wa mashonta wakuyi kwa Absalomu.<verse eid="2SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 18:6" />Hangu, lishonta lya Dawudi ligenda kushiwala kulikomanga na walishonta lya Israeli. Makomangu aga gatendekiti mulidowi lya Efraimu. <verse eid="2SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 18:7" />Wamashonta wa Dawudi wawakangiti wamashonta wa Abusolumu. Malaga ga lishaka ali gaweriti makulu toziya wantu malongu mawili elufu walagitwi. <verse eid="2SA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 18:8" />Makomangu aga gaeniyiti kuisi yoseri na wantu wavuwa wahowiti kulidowi waweriti wavuwa kuliku walii yawalagitwi kunkondu.<verse eid="2SA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 18:9" />Shakapanu Absalomu, pakawera kakwena punda farasi gwakuyi, kaliwoniti na wantumintumi wa Dawudi. Punda farasi ayu pakaweriti kankupita pasi pa lutambi lukulu lwa mtera gwa mwaloni, panu mtuyi gwa Abisalomu gulemetera kumwaloni. Abisalomu kalekwa kankutyeta pampindi. Kumbiti punda farasi gwakuyi kendereya kulongolu. <verse eid="2SA 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 18:10" />Muntu tunga yakawoniti shitwatira ashi, kamgambira Yoabu, “Nimwona Absalomu pakatyeta kumwaloni.”<verse eid="2SA 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 18:11" />Yoabu kamgambira muntu ayu, “Shishi? Gumwoniti Absalomu? Ntambu gaa, gumkoma ndiri palaa palii mpaka katuluka pasi? Menemaleri na kukupanana vipandi lilongu vya madini ga feza na lufunga.”<verse eid="2SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 18:12" />Kumbiti muntu ulii kamgambira Yoabu, “Ata megumpanani utopa wa vipandi elufu yimu vya madini ga feza mumawoku mwangu, mentalipisiyi ndiri liwoku lyangu kumkoma mwana gwa mfalumi. Toziya, tumpikiniriti mfalumi pakakugambira gwenga Abishai na Itai, toziya yaneni mmuloleri mntemba Absalomu. <verse eid="2SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 18:13" />Kumbiti handa menimtenderi kwa udoda na mfalumi mekakupikaniri gwenga gwamweni megulituli gweka na neni.”<verse eid="2SA 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 18:14" />Yoabu kamgambira, “Neni nahera shaka sha kwagamiziya pamuhera na gwenga.” Panu Yoabu katola migowa mididini mitatu, kagenda na kumsoma Abisalomu mumoyu, Yoabu pakaweriti kakugenda kumsoma kamwoniti Abusalomu kaweriti kankali mkomu pakatyeta kulutambi lwa mwaloni. <verse eid="2SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 18:15" />Shakapanu, wantemba lilongu yawamjegeriti vintu vya kulikomangira Yoabu, wiza kumzyengeta Abisalomu, wamkoma na kumlaga.<verse eid="2SA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 18:16" />Shakapanu Yoabu kagomba lipenka na mashonta woseri wawuya kuwafata wantu wa Israeli, toziya Yoabu kawabeliziyiti. <verse eid="2SA 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 18:17" />Watola nshimba ya Abisalomu wamwasa kulilindi likulu kulidowi na kumatira limatiru likulu nentu lya mabuwi. Wantu woseri wa Israeli watira, kila yumu ukaya kwakuyi.<verse eid="2SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 18:18" />Absalomu, Shaka sha ukomu wakuyi, kaweriti kalinyawira na kuligolosilila lupanda lwaluwera kululalanda lwa Mfalumi, kwa kalongiti, “Neni nahera mwana mpalu gwa kuhala litawu lyangu su liholuwi.” Lupanda kalupananiti litawu lyakuyi na lushemuwa “Lupanda lwa Abisalomu” mpaka leru.<verse eid="2SA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dawudi kankugambiruwa kuhowa kwa Abisalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 18:19" />Shakapanu, Ahimaasi mwana gwa Sadoki, kalonga, “Gundeki ntugi kumjegera mfalumi visoweru avi kuwera Mlungu kamlopola kulawa muwankondu wakuyi.”<verse eid="2SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 18:20" />Yoabu kamgambira, “leru, hapeni gujegi visoweru avi. Guweza kujega visoweru avi lishaka limonga. Kumbiti leru hapeni gujegi visoweru vyoseri toziya mwana gwa mfalumi kahowa.” <verse eid="2SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 18:21" />Shakapanu Yoabu kamgambiriti muntu yumu, muntu gwa likabila lya Kushi, “Gwenga, gugendi gwakamgambiri mfalumi galii yagaguwoniti.” Muntu gwa likabila lya Kushi kang'ong'onala kwa ligoya kulongolu kwa Yoabu, kawuka mbiru.<verse eid="2SA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 18:22" />Shakapanu Ahimaasi mwana gwa Sadoki kamgambira kayi Yoabu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:22">“Vidoda ndiri, gundeki ng'endi nimtugiri muntu ulii gwa likabila lya Kushi!” Yoabu kamgambira, “Mwana gwangu hashi gufira kutuga? Gwenga hapagufupwi shoseri kwa visoweru avi!”<verse eid="2SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 18:23" />Ahimaasi kamgambira, “Shoseri shagufira shirawiri na shirawiri, hantugi.” Su, Yoabu kamgambira,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:23">“Yina, gutugi.” Su Ahimaasi katuga pakafata njira ya kululalanda lwa Yoridani na kumlongolera muntu gwa likabila lya Kushi ulii.<verse eid="2SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 18:24" />Dawudi kaweriti kalikala pakati pa migomi mikulu miwili ya mji. Na mlolera gwa migomi mikulu kakwena kushibambaza mpaka pampindi pa migomi na pakanyasuliti masu gakuyi kawona muntu katuga gweka yakuyi. <verse eid="2SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 18:25" />Mlolera ayu kabota kamgambira mfalumi. Mfalumi kalonga, “Handa ka gweka yakuyi, guvimani kana visoweru.” Muntu ulii kongera kusegelera.<verse eid="2SA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 18:26" />Shakapanu mlolera kamwona muntu gwingi kankutuga, kamshema kayi mlolera gwa ligomi likulu pakalonga, “Guloli, muntu gwingi kankutuga gweka yakuyi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:26">Mfalumi kalonga, “Yomberi viraa kankujega ulagilagi.”<verse eid="2SA 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 18:27" />Mlolera ulii kalonga, “Mona kuwera ulii yakatuga nentu ndo Ahimaasi mwana gwa Sadoki.” Mfalumi kalonga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:27">“Ayu ndo muntu mheri, kankutujegera visoweru viheri.”<verse eid="2SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 18:28" />Hangu Ahimaasi kamgambira mfalumi kwa liziwu likulu, “Vitwatira vyoseri viherepa.” Kang'ong'onala kulongolu kwa mfalumi, kasuntamala na kulonga, “Kakwiswi Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku, kakupanana ukanka kwa wantu yawakugalambukiti gwenga, mtuwa gwangu mfalumi!”<verse eid="2SA 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 18:29" />Mfalumi kamgambira, “Hashi, mntemba Abisalomu kakashina?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:29">Ahimaasi kalonga, “Yoabu pakantumiti neni ntumintumi gwaku moniti kuweriti na showanganu zivuwa, kumbiti nivimaniti ndiri mana yakuyi.”<verse eid="2SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 18:30" />Mfalumi kalonga, “Gugoloki gulikali kumbwega na kugoloka panu.” Su, Ahimaasi kagenda kumbwega na kugoloka jii.<verse eid="2SA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 18:31" />Shakapanu pakasokiti kwa muntu gwa likabila lya Kushi ulii na yomberi kalonga, “Kwana visoweru viheri kwa gwenga mtuwa gwangu mfalumi! Toziya Mtuwa Mlungu leru ayi kakulopola kulawa mumakakala ga woseri walii yawafiliti kukulaga gwenga!”<verse eid="2SA 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 18:32" />Mfalumi kamkosiya,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:32">“Hashi mntemba Abisalomu kakashina?” Muntu gwa likabila lya Kushi kalonga, “Mtuwa gwangu mfalumi, wankondu waku pamuhera na woseri yawagoloka toziya ya gwenga pawakufilira vidoda, gawapati gambira ayu mntemba Abisalomu.”<verse eid="2SA 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 18:33" />Panu mfalumi kinginikiti nentu, kakwena kushumba sha lijengu shashiweriti pampindi pa ligomi likulu na kulira. Pakaweriti kankukwena, kaweriti kankulira pakalonga, “Nyeno mwana gwangu! Abisalomu, mwana gwangu Abisalomu! Mehowi neni! Gwee, Abisalomu mwana gwangu! Mwana gwangu!”<verse eid="2SA 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2SA 19" />
  <para style="s">Yoabu kankumkalipira Mfalumi Dawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 19:1" />Yoabu kagambiritwi handa mfalumi Dawudi kaweriti kankulira na kudaya kwa kuhowa kwa Abisalomu. <verse eid="2SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 19:2" />Hangu, ukanka wa lishaka ali ugalambulitwi kuwera kudaya kwa wantu woseri, pawapikiniriti kuwera mfalumi kankumdayilira Abisalomu. <verse eid="2SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 19:3" />Hangu, lishaka ali, wantu wingiriti kumji jiijii handa wantu yawawuya kumji pawawona soni kwa kutira nkondu. <verse eid="2SA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 19:4" />Mfalumi kaligibikiriti sheni shakuyi na kulila kwa kuguta pakalonga, “Nyeno mwana gwangu Abisalomu! Nyeno Abisalomu, mwana gwangu! Mwana gwangu!”<verse eid="2SA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 19:5" />Yoabu kingiliti ukaya kwa mfalumi, kamgambira, “Leru gutusoniziya twenga wantumintumi waku woseri weni leru tuwulopuziya ukomu waku, ukomu wa wana waku wapalu, ukomu wa wadala waku na ukomu wa wadala waku wa kunja. <verse eid="2SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 19:6" />Gwenga guwafira walii yawakukalalira na guwakalalira walii yawakufira. Gutulanguziya pota kufifa leru handa wakulu wa lishonta na wamashonta wawu shintu ndiri kwagwenga. Mona kuwera leru, handa Abisalomu mekaweri mkomu na twawoseri metuhowi na gwenga megunemeleri. <verse eid="2SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 19:7" />Vinu, gugoloki gwakayoweri na wamashonta waku kwa kunanagala toziya nililapa kwa Mlungu, handa gugenda ndiri kuyowera na womberi, kwahera ata yumu yakasigala pamuhera na gwenga leru pamihi. Ashi hashiweri shitwatira shidoda nentu kwa gwenga kuliku makontola goseri yagakupatiti kwanjira untemba waku mpaka leru.” <verse eid="2SA 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 19:8" />Shakapanu, Mfalumi kalawa kagenda kalivaga pahala pakuyi pakwegera na ligomi likulu. Wantu woseri pawagambiritwi handa mfalumi kakuligomi. Woseri wamgenderiti.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2SA 19:8">Duwudi kankulitanda kuwuya Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:8">Shaka ashi wantu woseri wa Israeli watuga na kugenda ukaya kwakuyi. <verse eid="2SA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 19:9" />Wantu woseri waweriti wangusingana mumakabila goseri ga Israeli, pawalonga, “Mfalumi Dawudi katulopoliti muwankondu mwetu Wafilisti. Kumbiti vinu kayituga isi toziya ya Abisalomu. <verse eid="2SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 19:10" />Kayi Abisalomu tumswagiti lipaki kaweri mfalumi gwetu, vinu kalaguwa kunkondu. Ntambu gaa vinu tuyowelera ndiri kumuwuziya mfalumi Dawudi?”<verse eid="2SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 19:11" />Mfalumi Dawudi kalagalira ulagilagi kwa watambika Sadoki na Abiatali, Muwagambiri wazewi wa Yuda, “Ntambu gaa womberi wawera wa upeleru kumwuziya mfalumi ukaya kwakuyi? Ulagilagi wa Israeli yoseri unsokera neni mfalumi. <verse eid="2SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 19:12" />Mwenga ndo walongu wangu na mwazi gwangu, ntambu gaa muweri wa upeleru kumbuziya neni mfalumi ukaya?” <verse eid="2SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 19:13" />Mmukosiyi viraa Amasa, “Yomberi ndo mlongu gwangu. Kayi Mlungu kandagi payiwera nimtenda ndiri yomberi kaweri mkulu gwa lishonta lyangu kwanjira leru pa Yakobu!” <verse eid="2SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 19:14" />Visoweru avi vya Dawudi viwatenditi wantu woseri wa Yuda wamjimili na waweriti handa muntu yumu. Hangu, wamjegera ulagilagi kulonga “Guwuyi ukaya, gwenga na wantumintumi waku woseri.”<verse eid="2SA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 19:15" />Su, mfalumi kiza lushemba Yoridana na wantu woseri wa Yuda wiza mpaka Giligali kumwanka mfalumi na kumlosiya lushemba Yoridani. <verse eid="2SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 19:16" />Shimeyi mwana gwa Gera gwa likabila lya Benjamini, kulawa Bahurimu, katenditi kalongola kugenda pamuhera na wantu wamonga su kumwanka mfalumi Dawudi. <verse eid="2SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 19:17" />Shimeyi kagenditi pamuhera na Wabenjamini elufu yimu. Siba ntumintumi gwa walongu wa Sauli, kiziti pamuhera na wana wakuyi lilongu na mhanu na wantumintumi malongu mawili, wagenditi kalongola kulushemba lwa Yoridani kumlongolera Dawudi. <verse eid="2SA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 19:18" />Su, waloka lushemba pamuhera na walongu wa mfalumi na kumtendera mfalumi goseri gakakafiriti. Shimeyi mwana gwa Gera kiza, kaliyasa kulongolu kwa mfalumi, kasuntamala, shaka mfalumi pakaweriti pakwegera kuloka lushemba Yoridani.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2SA 19:18">Dawudi kankulanguziya uheri wakuyi kwa Shimeyi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:18">Mfalumi kaweriti kala kuloka lushemba lwa Yolidani, Shimeyi kamsundamalira kulongolu kwakuyi <verse eid="2SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 19:19" />Shimeyi kamgambira mfalumi, “Nikuluwa, mtuwa gwangu mfalumi, naguhola kuwera nanashidoda pota kulihola lidoda lyanilitenditi lishaka lilii paguweriti gwakuwuka Yerusalemu. Nikuluwa nagugaholera. <verse eid="2SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 19:20" />Toziya, neni ntumintumi gwaku nivimana handa ntenditi vidoda. Niza leru, pawera gwa kwanja mulikabila lya Yosefu, kwiza kukwanka gwenga mtuwa gwangu, mfalumi.”<verse eid="2SA 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 19:21" />Abishai mwana gwa Seruya kalonga, “Hashi, mpaka ndiri Shimeyi kalaguwi? Toziya kapangiluwi muntu mweni Mlungu kamsyagula kwa kuswaga lipaki.”<verse eid="2SA 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 19:22" />Kumbiti Dawudi kalonga, “Wana wa Seruya, nahera shoseri na mwenga. Ntambu gaa mlitenda handa wankondu waneni leru? Hashi, kalaguwi muntu yoseri Muisraeli lishaka lya leru? Hashi, muvimana ndiri handa neni na mfalumi gwa Israeli lishaka lya leru?” <verse eid="2SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 19:23" />Shakapanu mfalumi kamlapira Shimeyi pakalonga, “Hapagulaguwi.”<verse eid="2SA 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dawudi kankumlekiziya Mefibosheti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 19:24" />Mefibosheti mzukulu gwa Sauli, kagenditi viraa kumwanka mfalumi Dawudi. Kwanjira lishaka lilii mfalumi pakawukiti Yerusalemu mpaka pakawuyiti mukomu, Mefibosheti kaweriti kagulula ndiri na kukuwa magulu gakuyi, kumoga ndevu zakuyi na kalishera ndiri kuputa nguwu zakuyi. <verse eid="2SA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 19:25" />Su, pakasokiti Yerusalemu kumwanka mfalumi, Dawudi kamkosiyiti, “Hashi, Mefibosheti, ntambu gaa gugenda ndiri na neni?”<verse eid="2SA 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 19:26" />Mefibosheti kalonga, “Gwee mtuwa gwangu mfalumi, guvimana handa neni nashikwawakwawa, nimgambiriti ntumintumi gwaku Ziba kantandiri punda su nimkweni ng'endi na gwenga mfalumi kumbiti kampayira. <verse eid="2SA 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 19:27" />Vinu, kampayikira kwa gwenga, gwee mtuwa gwangu mfalumi. Kumbiti gwenga, mtuwa gwangu mfalumi, guwera handa lihoka lya Mlungu. Gutendi lyoseri lyaguliwona ndo liheri kwa gwenga. <verse eid="2SA 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 19:28" />Toziya, walongu woseri wa wambuyi wa neni wafiruwitwi kulaguwa kulongolu kwaku, mtuwa gwangu mfalumi. Kumbiti guntuliti neni ntumintumi gwaku muwamu mwa walii yawaliya pameza paku. Hashi, nikuluwi shintu shimonga kwa gwenga?”<verse eid="2SA 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 19:29" />Mfalumi kamgambira, “Ntambu gaa gongera kuyowera vitwatira vyaku gamweni. Neni ntakula kala gwenga pamuhera na Siba hambagulani isi ya Sauli.”<verse eid="2SA 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 19:30" />Kumbiti Mefibosheti kamgambira mfalumi, “Gumjimili Siba kagatoli malambu goseri gweka yakuyi. Neni ntosiya handa gwenga mtuwa gwangu mfalumi guwuya ukaya mkomu.”<verse eid="2SA 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dawudi kankumtendera maheri Barizilayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 19:31" />Barizilayi, kulawa Gileadi kaweriti kasoka kulawa Rogelimu. Kaweriti kagenditi pamuhera na mfalumi kulushemba Yoridani su kamlosiya mpaka kumwambu kulushemba. <verse eid="2SA 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 19:32" />Barizilayi kaweriti mzewi nentu, yakana mivinja semanini. Yomberi kaweriti kamjegera shiboga mfalumi pakalikaliti aku Mahanaimu, toziya kaweriti mlunda nentu. <verse eid="2SA 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 19:33" />Su, mfalumi Dawudi kamgambira Barizilayi, “Tugendi woseri aku Yerusalemu Na neni hanikupanani vintu vyoseri vyagufira.”<verse eid="2SA 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 19:34" />Kumbiti Barizilayi kamgambira mfalumi, “Hashi, nana vinja vivuwa ndiri vya kulikala, ntambu gaa ng'endi na gwenga mfalumi mpaka Yerusalemu? <verse eid="2SA 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 19:35" />Neni leru nana mivinja semanini. Hashi, neni ntumintumi gwaku, mbeza kuvimana yagawera gaherepa na gadoda? Hashi, neni ntumintumi gwaku mbeza kuvimana kunoga kwa shilii shandiya ama kulanda? Hashi, mbeza kuvimana maziwu ga uherepa gawimba wapalu ama wadala? Ntambu gaa neni ntumintumi gwaku weri shisanka kwa mtuwa gwangu mfalumi? <verse eid="2SA 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 19:36" />Neni ntumintumi gwaku hang'endi na gwenga mwanja mfupi kumwambu Kuyoridani. Ntambu gaa, mfalumi gundipi lifupu likulu hangu? <verse eid="2SA 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 19:37" />Nikuluwa, gunjimiri neni ntumintumi gwaku, nfuwiri kumji gwangu, pakwegera na lisembi lya tati gwangu na mawu gwangu. Kumbiti ayu ntumintumi gwaku Kimhamu, gunjimiri ng'endi pamuhera na gwenga mtuwa gwangu mfalumi na gumtenderi shoseri shagushiwona shiherepa.”<verse eid="2SA 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 19:38" />Mfalumi kamgambira Barizilayi, “Kimhamu hakagendi na neni na hanimtenderi shoseri shashiwera shiheri kwa gwenga. Shoseri shagushifira, hanikutenderi.” <verse eid="2SA 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 19:39" />Wantu woseri ndo waloka lushemba lwa Yoridani na mfalumi na yomberi kaloka. Mfalumi kamnonera na kumtekelera Barizilayi na Barizilayi kawuya ukaya kwakuyi.<verse eid="2SA 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wa Yuda na wantu wa Israeli wankusinga kuusu mfalumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 19:40" />Mfalumi kendereya mpaka Gileadi, Kimhamu kawera kankulifata na yomberi. Wantu woseri wa Yuda na nusu ya wantu wa Israeli waweriti wankugenda nayu pamuhera. <verse eid="2SA 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 19:41" />Shakapanu, wantu woseri wa Israeli wiza kwa mfalumi na kumgambira, “Ntambu gaa walongu wetu wantu wa Yuda waweriti wakutola gwenga na wakulosiya lushemba lwa Yoridani, gwenga na walongu waku, pamuhera na wantu waku?”<verse eid="2SA 19:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 19:42" />Wantu wa Yuda wawagambira wantu wa Israeli, “Tutenda hangu toziya mfalumi Dawudi mlongu gwetu. Ntambu gaa mkalala kwa shitwatira ashi? Hashi, tuliya shoseri shilawiti kwa mfalumi? Yomberi katupanana lifupu lyoseri?”<verse eid="2SA 19:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 19:43" />Wantu wa Israeli wawankula wantu wa Yuda, “Twana vintu vya kulidumbila mala lilongu kwa mfalumi, kuliku vyamwera navi mwenga na Dawudi mweni. Ntambu gaa, mtubeziyiti? Tuwera ndiri wakwanja kulonga mfalumi gwetu kawuziwi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:43">Visoweru vya wantu wa Yuda viweriti vikalipa kuliku visoweru vya wantu wa Israeli.<verse eid="2SA 19:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2SA 20" />
  <para style="s">Sheba kankumlema mfalumi Dawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 20:1" />Aku Giligali kuweriti na muntu yumu mpayira yawamshema Sheba mwana gwa Bikiri muntu kulawa Benjamini. Su Sheba kagomba lipenga na kulonga, “Twahera ulongu nayu, mwana ayu gwa Yese, mwenga wantu wa Israeli, kila yumu na kaligenderi kulilingu kwakuyi!” <verse eid="2SA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 20:2" />Hangu, wantu woseri wa Israeli wamleka Dawudi, wamfata Sheba mwana gwa Bikiri. Kumbiti wantu wa Yuda wamfatiti mfalumi Dawudi kwa uwaminika kulawa lushemba lwa Yoridani mpaka mji gwa Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 20:3" />Shakapanu, Dawudi kasokiti ukaya kwakuyi kumjini Yerusalemu. Mfalumi kawatoliti wadala lilongu yawaweriti kawalekiti kulolera numba yakuyi kawatuliti mnumba yimu pasi pa ulolera, kawapananiti kila shintu, kumbiti kagonja ndiri nawa. Hangu, wadala awa waweriti wawatatira mngati mpaka lishaka lya kuhowa kwawomberi, walikala handa, waweriti wakenja.<verse eid="2SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 20:4" />Shakapanu, mfalumi kamgambira Amasa, “Gunjonjoniri wamashonta woseri wa Yuda mulishaka lya tatu na gamweni gwenga guweri.” <verse eid="2SA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 20:5" />Su, Amasa kagenda kuwashema wamashonta wa Yuda. Kumbiti kakawalira kuwuya mushaka galii yagatulitwi na mfalumi. <verse eid="2SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 20:6" />Dawudi kamgambira Abishai, “Vinu, Sheba mwana gwa Bikiri, hakatujegeri ntabiku kuliku Abisalomu. Gutoli wantumintumi wa neni, gumfati Sheba nakiza kwingira kumiji yana liboma kalipoti, natumwona kayi.” <verse eid="2SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 20:7" />Abishai kalawiti pamuhera na wamashonta wa Yoabu na Wakereti na Wapeleti pamuhera na makambaku woseri. Woseri awa wawukiti Yerusalemu kugenda kumfata Sheba mwana gwa Bikiri. <verse eid="2SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 20:8" />Pawasokiti kulitalawu likulu lyaliwera aku Gibioni, Amasa kalawa kuwanka. Yoabu kaweriti kavala nguwu za shishonta na mngati mwa nguwu azi kuweriti na lufunga lwalukoleriti ligumba mshunu mwakuyi paliwera kuhala yakuyi. Yoabu pakaweriti kankusegelera, ligumba lyakuyi lisomokiti mhala lituluka pasi. <verse eid="2SA 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 20:9" />Yoabu kamgambira Amasa, “Hashi, gwakashina mlongu gwangu?” Yoabu kamkola Amasa kushirevu kwa liwoku lya kumliwu handa kafiri kamlamsiyi kwa kumkisikira. <verse eid="2SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 20:10" />Kumbiti Amasa kaliwona ndiri ligumba lyaliweriti mliwoku mwa Yoabu, Su, Yoabu kamsoma Amasa ligumba kumtima kwakuyi utumbu ulawa kunja, kahowa. Yoabu kamsoma ndiri ligumba mala ya pili.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:10">Shakapanu, Yoabu na mlongu gwakuyi Abishai, wendereya kumfatiriya Sheba mwana gwa Bikiri. <verse eid="2SA 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 20:11" />Lishonta yumu gwa Yoabu kiza kagoloka pakwegera na nshimba ya Amasa, kalonga, “Muntu yoseri yakamfira Yoabu na yakamfira Dawudi, kamfati Yoabu!” <verse eid="2SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 20:12" />Amasa kaweriti kagonja mumwazi gwakuyi pakati pa njira nkulu. Kila muntu kawona yakapititi panu, kagoloka kulola. Kumbiti muntu ulii pakawoniti handa wantu woseri yawawiziti na kugoloka panu, kayiwusiyiti nshimba ya Amasa kunjira, kayijega kulilambu na kumugibikira kwa nguwu. <verse eid="2SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 20:13" />Nshimba ya Amasa payiwusiwitwi kunjira nkulu, wantu woseri pamuhera na Yoabu wagenditi kumfata Sheba mwana gwa Bikiri.<verse eid="2SA 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 20:14" />Sheba kapitiliti mumakabila goseri ga Israeli mpaka mji gwa Abeli Beti Maaka. Wantu woseri wa lukolu lwa Bikiri wajojonika na kumfata. <verse eid="2SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 20:15" />Wamashonta woseri yawaweriti pamuhera na Yoabu wagenda kumzyengeta Sheba pakaweriti kumji agu gwa Abeli gwa Beti Maaka. Wamamatira vidunda vya litapaka kuzyengeta mji na liboma shakapanu wanja kubomola shibambaza su kushigusiya pasi. <verse eid="2SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 20:16" />Shakapanu, mdala tunga kana luhala kapikinika kulawa mjini pakalonga, “Mumpikiniri! Mumpikiniri! Mumgambiri Yoabu kizi nyoweri na yomberi.” <verse eid="2SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 20:17" />Yoabu kagenda pakwegera na yomberi, mdala ayu kamgambira, “Hashi, gwenga ndo Yoabu?” Yoabu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">“Yina! Ndo neni.” Mdala ulii kamgambira,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">“Gumpikiniri neni ntumintumi gwaku.” Yoabu kamgambira,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">“Nikupikinira.” <verse eid="2SA 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 20:18" />Mdala ayu kamgambira, “Makashu wantu waweriti wankulonga, muntu pakafira utakulu kagendi mji gwa Aberi. Hangu ndo wantu ntambu yawausiyiti madoda gawu. <verse eid="2SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 20:19" />Neni ndo yumu gwawu gwa walii yawafira ponga na waminika mu Israeli. Hashi vinu gwenga gufira kuhalibisiya mji yaguwera handa mawu mu Israeli. Ntambu gaa vinu gufira kutobomolera mji yaguwera gwa Mtuwa Mlungu?”<verse eid="2SA 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 20:20" />Yoabu kankula, “Nakaka mumakaliru gangu! Nahera nfiru ya kugubomola mji. <verse eid="2SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 20:21" />Ntambu yagutakuliti nakaka ndiri! Kumbiti muntu yumu kulawa seemu ya migongu ya Efraimu yawamshema Sheba mwana gwa Bikiri kafira kumlema mfalumi Dawudi. Gumlaviyi ayu kwaneni na neni hambuki kumji gwenu.” Mdala ulii kamgambira Yoabu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:21">“Mtuwi gwakuyi hagugumiruwi kwa kupitira kushibambaza.” <verse eid="2SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 20:22" />Shakapanu mdala ulii kwa luhala lwakuyi kagenda kwa wantu woseri mjini. Wagulikituliti mtuyi gwa Sheba mwana gwa Bikiri, wagwasa kunja kwa Yoabu. Hangu, Yoabu kagomba lipenga na kuwapalasiya wantu wakuyi kulawa mji agu gwa Abeli, kila muntu kagenda ukaya kwakuyi. Shakapanu Yoabu kawuya kwa mfalumi Dawudi, kumji gwa Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walanga ya watanga wa Dawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 20:23" />Yoabu kaweriti mkulu gwa shonta lyoseri lya Israeli. Benaya mwana gwa Yehoyada kaweriti mkulu gwa Wakereti na Wapereti yawaweriti walolera wakuyi mweni. <verse eid="2SA 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 20:24" />Adoramu kaweriti mgolokera gwa lihengu lya kukakanikwa, Yehoshafati kaweriti mlemba gwa maholu. <verse eid="2SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 20:25" />Shawusa kaweriti mlemba, Sadoki na Abitari waweriti watambika. <verse eid="2SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 20:26" />Ira muntu gwa Yairi kaweriti viraa mtambika gwa Dawudi.<verse eid="2SA 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2SA 21" />
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wa Sauli wankulaguwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 21:1" />Shaka shimu kulawiriti njala nkulu Kuisi ya Dawudi pakaweriti mfalumi. Njala ayi ikaliti vinja vitatu vigenderanu. Dawudi kamluwiti Mlungu shakutenda na Mlungu kamwankula, “Sauli na walongu wakuyi watenda vidoda kwa kulaga toziya kawalagiti Wagibioni.” <verse eid="2SA 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 21:2" />Hangu, mfalumi Dawudi kawashema Wagibioni, Wagibioni awa waweriti ndiri Waisraeli ila waweriti wiwuka wa Waamoni. Tembera wantu wa Israeli walilapa kuwalolela, Kumbiti Sauli kajeriti kuwalaga woseri toziya kaweriti na weya kwa wantu wa Israeli na Yuda. <verse eid="2SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 21:3" />Dawudi kawakosiya Wagidioni, “Niwatenderi shishi? Handipi hashi kwa makontola gamtenderitwi su muyitekelera isi ayi na wantu wakuyi Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="2SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 21:4" />Wagibioni wamgambira, “Shitwatira shetu na Sauli pamuhera na kaya yakuyi hapeni shipeli kwa kupananwa madini gwa feza ama zahabu na tufira ndiri kumlaga muntu yoseri muisi ya Israeli.” Mfalumi kawakosiya kayi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:4">“Vinu mlonga niwatenderi shishi?”<verse eid="2SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 21:5" />Womberi wamgambira mfalumi, “Sauli kafiliti kutulaga twenga na kutwagwamiziya na kufila muntu yoseri kasigali poseri museemu yoseri ya Israeli. <verse eid="2SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 21:6" />Su, gutupanani wana saba wapalu muwiwuka wakuyi na twenga tuwatyetiziyi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kulugongu Gibea, kumji gwa mfalumi Sauli yakalumikitwi na Mtuwa Mlungu.” Mfalumi kalonga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:6">“haniwapanani wantu awa.”<verse eid="2SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 21:7" />Kumbiti mfalumi kamleka mkomu Mefibosheti mwana gwa Yonatani, mzukulu gwa Sauli, toziya ya kulilapa kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu pakati pa Dawudi na Yonatani. <verse eid="2SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 21:8" />Kumbiti Mfalumi kawatola Arimoni na Mefiboshiti wana wawili wa Risipa mhinga gwa Ahiya yakaleriti na Sauli, pamuhera na wana woseri mhanu wapalu Wamikali, mhinga gwa Sauli kamleleriti Adirieli mwana gwa Bazilayi kulawa Mmeholati. <verse eid="2SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 21:9" />Dawudi kawapananiti wantu saba awa kwa Wagibioni na womberi watyetiziwa kulugongu pahala pakumguwila Mtuwa Mlungu, woseri saba wafuwa pamuhera. Wantu awa walagitwi mumashaka ga kwanja ga mabenu ga shayili.<verse eid="2SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 21:10" />Risipa mhinga gwa Ahiya katoliti nguwu ya lifafa, kayalika kulitalawu. Kalikaliti panu kwanjira kwanja kwa kubenanga mpaka shaka sha mvula pashisokiti na kugatowera mauti. Shaka shoseri ashi, kawawingiti wampongu wa kuliyera na vigongolu, pashiru na paliwala, su nawagasegelera mauti aga.<verse eid="2SA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 21:11" />Dawudi pakapikiniriti galii gakatenditi Risipa mhinga gwa Ahiya, mdala gwa kunja gwa Sauli, <verse eid="2SA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 21:12" />Kagenditi na kuitola mihonju ya Sauli na mwana gwakuyi yawamshema Yonatani kulawa wenikaya wa Yabeshi Gileadi, yawaweriti wiwa kulawa luwaga lwa wantu woseri aku Beti Sheani, kweni Wafiristi waweriti wamtyetiziya Sauli na Yonatani lishaka lilii Wafiristi pawamlagiti Sauli kulugongu Giliboa. <verse eid="2SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 21:13" />Su, Dawudi kayiwuziya mifupa ya Sauli na Yonatani mwana gwakuyi kulawa aku, shakapanu wajojonira mifupa ya wantemba saba yawatyetiziwitwi. <verse eid="2SA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 21:14" />Su wayisira mifupa ya Sauli na Yonatani mwana gwakuyi muisi ya Benjamini, aku Sela mulisembi lya Kishi tati gwakuyi Sauli. Watenditi kila shintu sheni mfalumi kawalagaliriti. Pa aga, Mlungu kakupikinira kulira kwawu muisi yawu.<verse eid="2SA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkondu na makambaku wa Wafiristi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 20:4-8">1 Mirandu 20:4-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 21:15" />Shakapanu Wafiristi walikomangiti nkondu kayi na Waisraeli. Dawudi na wamashonta wakuyi wagenda kulikomanga na Wafiristi. Aku Dawudi katokiti nentu. <verse eid="2SA 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 21:16" />Ishibi Benobu, yumu gwawu gwa walera wa Refayi likambaku kana mgowa gwakuyi gwa shaba guweriti na utopa wa kilu ntatu na nusu na yakaweriti kalitawa ligumba lyasyayi pakalonga hakamlagi Dawudi. <verse eid="2SA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 21:17" />Kumbiti Abishai mwana gwakuyi Seruya, kagenditi kumtanga Dawudi. Abishai kamkomiti Mfilisti ulii na kumlaga. Hangu, wamashonta wamlapira Dawudi pawalonga, “Hapeni tugendi kayi na gwenga kunkondu, toziya gwenga gwa litumbiru lya Israeli na tufira ndiri kuliyagamiziya.”<verse eid="2SA 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 21:18" />Pa aga, kulawiriti kayi makomangu na Wafiristi aku Gobu. Aku Sibekayi kulawa Husha, kamlagiti likambaku Safu yakaweriti yumu gwa walera wa Warefayi.<verse eid="2SA 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 21:19" />Kulawiriti kayi na makomangu na Wafiristi aku Gobu. Elihani mwana gwa Yaare oregimu kulawa Betilehemu, kamlagiti Goliyati kulawa Giti, mhanya gwa mgowa gwakuyi handa mtera mkulu gwa mtuga mbewa.<verse eid="2SA 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 21:20" />Shakapanu kulawiriti kayi nkondu aku Gati kweni kuweriti na muntu yumu kaweriti mtali nentu na kana vyala sita mukila shiwoku na vyala sita mukila ligulu, jumla yakuyi vyala ishilini na msheshi. Yomberi viraa kaweriti mwiwuka gwa makambaku. <verse eid="2SA 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 21:21" />Pakawajongeriti Waisraeli, Yonatani mwana gwa Shimeyi, mlongu gwakuyi Dawudi, kamlagiti.<verse eid="2SA 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 21:22" />Wamsheshi awa yawaweriti wiwuka wa makambaku shiwuku sha Warefayi aku Gati na womberi walaguwitwi na Dawudi pamuhera na wamashonta wakuyi.<verse eid="2SA 21:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2SA 22" />
  <para style="s">Lwimbu lwa ukanka wa Dawudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="PSA 18">Zabuli 18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 22:1" />Dawudi kamwimbiriti Mtuwa Mlungu visoweru vya lwimbu alu lishaka lilii Mtuwa Mlungu pakamlopoliti mumawoku mwa wankondu wakuyi na mumawoku mwa Sauli.<verse eid="2SA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 22:2" />“Kalongiti, Mtuwa Mlungu ndo mlolera gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:2">liboma lya neni na mkombola gwangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 22:3" />Mlungu gwangu, mlolera gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">kwakuyi mponeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">kandolelera handa ngawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">kandolera na kunopola kulawa kwa wantu njimbituwa.<verse eid="2SA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 22:4" />Nimshema Mtuwa Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:4">Mlungu yakana zyumwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:4">yomberi kanopola kulawa kwa wankondu wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 22:5" />Makupala ga kuhowa gazyengetiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:5">lirawa lya maagamiziya gankankaliti,<verse eid="2SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 22:6" />Ngoyi za isi ya wantu wahowa zizyengeta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:6">migomiziwu ya kuhowa iweriti kwangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 22:7" />Mukutabika kwa neni, nimshemiti Mtuwa Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">Nimlilila Mlungu gwangu kantangi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">Yomberi kapikaniliti liziwu lyangu kulawa kunumba nkulu yakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">gumpikaniliti kulira kwangu panikuluwiti utanga.<verse eid="2SA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 22:8" />Pasipanu hapalendemeri na kubegeziwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:8">miyanjiru ya kumpindi itikanyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:8">toziya Mlungu kaweriti kakalala!<verse eid="2SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 22:9" />Lyosi litumiti kulawa mumpula mwakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:9">motu gwagulunguziya gulawa mmulomu mwakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:9">makala ga motu yagakiti galawa amu.<verse eid="2SA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 22:10" />Kalipanda liyera, kasuluka pasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:10">liwundi lititu liweriti pasi pa magulu gakuyi.<verse eid="2SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 22:11" />Kakweniti shiwumbi shana mbapatiru na kuguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:11">kuwoneka luwindi pampindi handa mbapatiru.<verse eid="2SA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 22:12" />Kaligibikiliti luwindu wega zoseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:12">shifiniku shakuyi shiweriti mawundi gazotopa ga mvula.<verse eid="2SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 22:13" />Lumeta lumulikiti kulongolu kwakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:13">miyali ya motu ilawiti mumakala.<verse eid="2SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 22:14" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalindimila kulawa kumpindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:14">liziwu lyakuyi Mlungu mkulu lipikanika.<verse eid="2SA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 22:15" />Kawaguma misali wankondu wakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:15">kwa lumeta kawatenda watugi.<verse eid="2SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 22:16" />Mtuwa Mlungu pakawakalipiliti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">kulawilana na pumula yayilawa mumpula mwakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">pasi nakamu pa bahari pagubutulitwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">miyanjiru ya pasipanu iwoneka.<verse eid="2SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 22:17" />Mlungu katalapisiyiti liwoku lyakuyi kulawa kumpindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:17">kantola, kulawa kumashi gavuwa kanyasuliti.<verse eid="2SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 22:18" />Kanopoliti kulawa mwa nkondu wangu yakana likakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:18">kanopoliti kulawa kwa awa yawankaliliti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:18">toziya waweriti na makakala gavuwa kunkanka.<verse eid="2SA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 22:19" />Wankankaliti paweriti mukutabika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:19">kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kantangiti. <verse eid="2SA 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 22:20" />Kanjegiti na kantula pahala pa uponera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:20">kamponiziyiti, toziya kafiriziwitwi na neni.<verse eid="2SA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 22:21" />Mtuwa Mlungu kanupiti lifupu toziya nahera shidoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:21">kantuliti weri toziya nahera shidoda.<verse eid="2SA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 22:22" />Toziya, nfata njira za Mtuwa Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:22">pota kumleka Mlungu gwangu kwa ukontola.<verse eid="2SA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 22:23" />Nkola malagalira gakuyi goseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:23">noya ndiri kufata lagiru zakuyi.<verse eid="2SA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 22:24" />Kulongolu kwakuyi weriti ndiri na shidoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:24">nililolera nawera na shidoda.<verse eid="2SA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 22:25" />Mtuwa Mlungu kantula weri ntambu ya waminika wa neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:25">yomberi kavimana uherepa wa neni.<verse eid="2SA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 22:26" />Gwenga Mtuwa Mlungu ndo mwaminika kwa yawawera waminika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:26">mheri kwa walii wayawera waheri.<verse eid="2SA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 22:27" />Gwenga gulilangaziya gwahera madoda kwa walii yawahera madoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:27">kumbiti gwahera lusungu kwa wantu wakontola.<verse eid="2SA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 22:28" />Gwenga guwalopola yawawera wananaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:28">kumbiti guwalola wanamalingu guwasulusiya.<verse eid="2SA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 22:29" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, gwenga gwa lumuliku lwa neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:29">Mlungu gwangu, yaguwinga luwindu lwa neni. <verse eid="2SA 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 22:30" />Kwa utanga waku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:30">gushikomanga shipinga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:30">Gwenga gunupa likakala lya kukopoka vibambaza vyakuyi.<verse eid="2SA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 22:31" />Shakatenda Mlungu shahera madoda!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:31">Shakalongiti Mtuwa Mlungu ndo shaminika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:31">yomberi ndo mlolera kwa woseri yawamtugira.<verse eid="2SA 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 22:32" />Kwahera mlungu handa gwenga ila gwenga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:32">Gaa yakawera mlolera gambira Mlungu gwetu?<verse eid="2SA 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 22:33" />Mlungu ayu ndo tugira ya neni igangamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:33">na kayitenda njira ya neni iweri uponera.<verse eid="2SA 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 22:34" />Kagagangamiziya magulu ga neni handa ga funu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:34">na kuntula ponera pahala pampindi.<verse eid="2SA 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 22:35" />Kanfunda kulikomanga nkondu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:35">mawoku gangu gaweza kunika upindi wa shaba.<verse eid="2SA 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 22:36" />Gundolera na gundopola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:36">utanga waku untenda weri mkulu.<verse eid="2SA 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 22:37" />Njira ya neni ikamala ndiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:37">pota magulu gangu gatyerebuka ndiri.<verse eid="2SA 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 22:38" />Niwafatiti wankondu wangu na kuwagamiziya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:38">Mbuyiti ndiri kumbeli mpaka niwagamiziya woseri.<verse eid="2SA 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 22:39" />Niwagusiya pasi na kuwagamiziya, nawaweza kugoloka kayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:39">waguwiti pasi pa magulu gangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 22:40" />Gunupiti likakala lya kulikomanga nkondu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:40">gumpanana ukanka kwa wankondu.<verse eid="2SA 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 22:41" />Guwatenditi wankondu wa neni watugi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:41">na walii yawankalaliriti niwagamiziyiti.<verse eid="2SA 22:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 22:42" />Wasakuliti utanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:42">kumbiti paweriti ndiri na gwa kuwalopola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:42">wamliliriti Mtuwa Mlungu, kawawankula ndiri,<verse eid="2SA 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 22:43" />Niwatwangiti na kuwaposhola handa madiku ga pasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:43">niwaposhola na kuwatimbanga handa madika mnjira.<verse eid="2SA 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2SA 22:44" />Gunopola na makomangu ga wantu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:44">guntenda kuwera mkolamlima gwa isi zimonga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:44">Wantu yaniwamana ndiri wantendendera.<verse eid="2SA 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="2SA 22:45" />Wahenga waniziliti pawananagala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:45">katepu pawapikiniriti visoweru vyangu wanjimiliti.<verse eid="2SA 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="2SA 22:46" />Wahenga wiza na kung'ong'onalira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:46">wiza kulawa mumaboma gawu pawalendemera.<verse eid="2SA 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="2SA 22:47" />Mtuwa Mlungu ka mkomu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:47">Kazyumwi mlolera gwangu! Kakwiswi Mlungu gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:47">mlolera gwa ulopola wangu!<verse eid="2SA 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="2SA 22:48" />Yomberi kantenda mbezi kuwankaka wankondu wangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:48">kantula niwakolimlima wantu wa maisi gamonga.<verse eid="2SA 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="2SA 22:49" />Kampanana ukanka kulawa kwa wankondu wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:49">Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:49">gumpanana ukanka kwa wankondu wa neni na kumponiziya kutali na wantu wangesera.<verse eid="2SA 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="2SA 22:50" />Hangu hanikuzyumi pakati pa wantu wa isi zimonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:50">hanimbi zyuma zaku gwee Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="2SA 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="2SA 22:51" />Mlungu gumpanana mfalumi gwaku ukanka mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:51">gumlanguziya utanga waku ayu yakamlumikitwi, yina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:51">gumtangi Dawudi na walera wakuyi mashaka goseri.”<verse eid="2SA 22:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2SA 23" />
  <para style="s">Visoweru vya kumalila vya Dawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 23:1" />Avi ndo visoweru vya upeleru vya Dawudi, mwana gwa Yese, muntu mweni Mlungu kamtenditi kaweri mkulu. Mlungu gwa Yakobu kamsyaguliti Dawudi kuwera mfalumi na visoweru vyakuyi wantu wa Israeli wanemeleliti kwimba.<verse eid="2SA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 23:2" />Rohu ya Mtuwa Mlungu ilonga kwa kupitira neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:2">kavituliti visoweru vyakuyi mumlomu mwangu.<verse eid="2SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 23:3" />Mlungu gwa Israeli kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">mlolera gwa Israeli kang'ambira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">mfalumi pakawakolamlima wantu kwa ntambu yakafira Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">hakakolimlima kwa kumtira Mlungu,<verse eid="2SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 23:4" />yomberi ndo handa gulangala gwa mandawira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:4">mshenji pagulawira mandawira kwahera na mawundi, yina, handa mvula yayitenda ntuntu imeri mulitapaka.<verse eid="2SA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 23:5" />Hangu ndo ntambu Mlungu hakayitekeleri kaya yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">Toziya katenda na neni lipatanu lya mashaka goseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">lipatanu nakamu na ligangamaliti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">Na yomberi hakanupi kwa nfiru yangu yoseri.<verse eid="2SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 23:6" />Kumbiti yawamana ndiri Mlungu woseri ndo handa misomi yaiyaswa hera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:6">toziya hapeni itolwi kwa mawoku,<verse eid="2SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 23:7" />Muntu yakaikola, mpaka katenderi shuma ama mhanya gwa mgoha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:7">Wantu awa hawalunguziwi nakamu kwa motu.<verse eid="2SA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lishonta ligangamala lya Dawudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 11:10-41">1 Mirandu 11:10-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 23:8" />Aga ndo matawu ga makambaku yakaweriti nawa Dawudi. Yoshebi Bashebeti na Mtakimoni, yakaweriti mlonguziya gwa walii watatu, yomberi kalikomangiti kwa mgowa gwakuyi, kawalaga wantu miya nani shaka shimu.<verse eid="2SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 23:9" />Shakapanu yakafatiti muwamu mwa walii makambaku watatu kaweriti Eleazari mwana gwa Dodo, gwa lukolu lwa Ahohi. Lishaka limu, Eleazari kaweriti pamuhera na Dawudi pawawigirangiti Wafiristi yawaweriti wajojonika kulikomanga nkondu. Waisraeli pawawatiriti Wafiristi. <verse eid="2SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 23:10" />Kumbiti Eleazari kagangamaliti na kulikomanga na Wafiristi mpaka liwoku lyakuyi likakamala, lisigala likolelera ligumba lyakuyi. Lishaka ali, Mtuwa Mlungu kalipananiti ukanka mkulu. Pa ukanka awu, Waisraeli wawuyiti pahala pakaweriti Eleazari na kulipanana lopola za hera kulawa kwa Wafiristi yawalagitwi.<verse eid="2SA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 23:11" />Shikambaku gwa tatu kaweriti Shama mwana gwa Ageyi kulawa Harari. Wafiristi wajojonikiti aku Lehi, pahala papaweriti na lirambu lya dengu ivuwa, Waisraeli wawatugiti Wafiristi. <verse eid="2SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 23:12" />Kumbiti kaligangamiziyiti mulirambu ali su kulikomangira na yomberi kawalaga Wafiristi. Mtuwa Mlungu kalipanana ukanka mkulu.<verse eid="2SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 23:13" />Shakapanu, makambaku watatu pakati pa wakulu selasini waseleriti shaka sha kubenanga wasoka kwa Dawudi kumpanga aku Adulamu. Shaka ashi lishonta lya Wafiristi liweriti litula lugonjeru mululalanda lwa Refaimu. <verse eid="2SA 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 23:14" />Shaka ashi Dawudi kaweriti aku Adulamu pahala papalolilitwi nentu na lishonta lya Wafiristi liweriti kumji gwa Betilehemu. <verse eid="2SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 23:15" />Dawudi kalonga kwa nfiru nkulu, “Handa muntu mekawezi kumpanana mashi ga kulanda kulawa mulinegu lya Betilehemu lyaliwera pakwegera na ligomi likulu lya mji!” <verse eid="2SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 23:16" />Walii makambaku wakuyi watatu walawiti, wapena mulugonjeru lwa lishonta lya Wafiristi, wagenda na kuteka mashi mulinegu lya Betilehemu, pakwegera na ligomi lya mji, wamjegera Dawudi. Dawudi kalemiti kugalanda mashi aga na badala yakuyi, kita pasi handa tambiku kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, <verse eid="2SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 23:17" />kalonga, “Hapeni nandi mashi aga! Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, hayiweri handa nanda mwazi gwa walii yawafiriti ata kuhowa!” Hangu, Dawudi kagalanda ndiri mashi aga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:17">Avi ndo vitwatira vyawatenditi makambaku watatu walii.<verse eid="2SA 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 23:18" />Abishai mlongu gwakuyi Yoabu, mwana gwa Seruya, kaweriti mkulu gwa makambaku selasini. Yomberi kalikomangiti kwa mgoha gwakuyi na wantu miya tatu na kawalaga, kaweriti kazyumwa muwamu mwa walii makambaku watatu. <verse eid="2SA 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 23:19" />Kaweriti kamanika nentu muwamu mwa walii makambaku selasini na kawera mkulu gwawu, kumbiti kaweriti ndiri handa makambaku watatu walii.<verse eid="2SA 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 23:20" />Benaya mwana gwa Yehoyada, kulawa Kabizeeli, kaweriti shonta mgangamala mweni katenda vitwatira vivuwa vya kulikangasha. Kawalagiti makambaku wawili kulawa Mowabu na lishaka limu shaka sha barafu, kasulukiti kulirindi na kumlaga simba. <verse eid="2SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 23:21" />Viraa kamlagiti shikambaku gwa Misri. Mmisri ayu kaweriti na mgoha, kumbiti Benaya kamgenderiti pakawera na luhonga hera, kampoka mgoha agu na kumlaga Mmisri ayu kwa mgoha gwakuyi mweni. <verse eid="2SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 23:22" />Benaya, mwana gwa Yehoyada katenditi vitwatira avi, kazyumitwi nentu muwamu mwa walii makambaku watatu. <verse eid="2SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 23:23" />Su, kaweriti kamanika nentu pakati pa walii makambaku selasini, kumbiti kawera ndiri handa makambaku watatu walii. Dawudi kampanana ukulu wa walolera wakuyi mweni.<verse eid="2SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 23:24" />Asaheli, mlongu gwakuyi Yoabu, kaweriti yumu gwa makambaku Selasini. Makambaku wamonga wa Dawudi waweriti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:24">Elihanani, mwana gwa Dodo kulawa Betilehemu,<verse eid="2SA 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 23:25" />Shamma na Elika walawa mulukolu lya Harodi,<verse eid="2SA 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 23:26" />Helesi muntu gwa kulawa Paliti na Ira mwana gwa Ikeshi kulawa Tekoa,<verse eid="2SA 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 23:27" />Abiezeri kulawa Anatoti na Mebunai kulawa Hushati,<verse eid="2SA 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 23:28" />Salimoni kulawa Ahohi na Maharai kulawa Netofati,<verse eid="2SA 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 23:29" />Helebu mwana gwa Baana kulawa Netofati, Itai mwana gwa Ribai kulawa Gibea muntu gwa Benjamini,<verse eid="2SA 23:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 23:30" />Benaya kulawa Piratoni na Hidayi gwa vishemba vya Gaashi,<verse eid="2SA 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 23:31" />Abialiboni kulawa Haribati na Azimaweti kulawa Bahurimu,<verse eid="2SA 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 23:32" />Eliaba kulawa Shaaliboni wana wa Yasheni na Yonatani,<verse eid="2SA 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 23:33" />Shamma kulawa likabila lya Harari na Ahimu mwana gwa Sharari kulawa likabila lya Harari,<verse eid="2SA 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 23:34" />Elifeleti mwana gwa Ahasibayi kulawa Maaka na Eliamu mwana gwa Ahitofeli kulawa Giloni,<verse eid="2SA 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 23:35" />Hesirawi kulawa Karimeli na Paarayi kulawa Waribi,<verse eid="2SA 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 23:36" />Igali mwana gwa Natani kulawa Soba na Bani kulawa Gadi,<verse eid="2SA 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 23:37" />Seleki kulawa Amoni na Naharai kulawa Beeruti yakaweriti mpapa vintu vya kulikomangira nkondu gwa Yoabu mwana gwa Seruya,<verse eid="2SA 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 23:38" />Ira na Garebu kulawa likabila lya Witiri,<verse eid="2SA 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 23:39" />Uria kulawa Hiti. Woseri pamuhera waweriti makambaku selasina na saba.<verse eid="2SA 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2SA 24" />
  <para style="s">Dawudi kankuwawalanga wantu wa Waisreli na Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 21:1-27">1 Mirandu 21:1-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 24:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawakalaliriti kayi Waisraeli, kamsongiziya Dawudi kwa womberi, “Kamgambira Dawudi kawawalangi wantu wa Israeli na wantu wa Yuda.” <verse eid="2SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 24:2" />Hangu, mfalumi kamgambira Yoabu na mkulu gwa lishonta yawaweriti pamuhera na yomberi, “Mgendi mumakabila goseri ga Israeli kulawa Beeri Sheba yayiwera uwega wa kusika mpaka Dani yayiwera uwega wa kushana, muwawalangi wantu su mpati kuvimana walanga yawu.”<verse eid="2SA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 24:3" />Kumbiti Yoabu kamgambira mfalumi, “Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku na kawongeri Waisraeli mala miya kuliku ntambu yawawera vinu na gwenga mtuwa gwangu mfalumi gupati kulola yongeleka ayi kwa masu gaku gamweni. Kumbiti, ntambu gaa gwenga mtuwa gwangu mfalumi gufira kutenda hangu?” <verse eid="2SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 24:4" />Kumbiti litakulu lya mfalumi liweriti na likakala nentu kwa Yoabu na wakulu wa lishonta! Su, Yoabu na wakulu wa lishonta wawuka kulongolu kwa mfalumi wagenda kuwawalanga Waisraeli.<verse eid="2SA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 24:5" />Walokiti lushemba lwa Yoridani nakutula ngonjeru kushana mwa Aroeri mumji yaguwera kululalanda lwalugenda Gadi Mpaka Yazeri. <verse eid="2SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 24:6" />Wagenda muisi ya Gileadi shakapanu Kadeshi muisi ya Wahiti, su wasoka Dani na kulawa Dani wazyengeta kugenda Sidoni, <verse eid="2SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 24:7" />shakapanu wagenditi kuliboma lya mji gwa Tiro, wingira kumiji yoseri ya Wahivi na Wakanaani. Pawamaliliti, wagenditi uwega wa kushana mwa Yuda aku Beeri Sheba. <verse eid="2SA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 24:8" />Iwatola miezi tisa na shaka ishilini kuuzyengeta isi yoseri, Shakapanu wawuya Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 24:9" />Shakapanu Yoabu kamjegeriti mfalumi walanga ya wantu. Muisi ya Israeli kuweriti wapalu laki nani yawaweza kulikoma nkondu na muisi ya Yuda, kuweriti na wapalu laki tanu yawaweza kulikoma nkondu.<verse eid="2SA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 24:10" />Kumbiti moyu gwakuyi Dawudi guweliti gumtama nentu pa kuwawalanga wantu. Hangu, Dawudi kamgambira Mtuwa Mlungu, “Ntenda Vidoda vikulu kwa shitendu shantenditi. Kumbiti vinu, gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, nikuluwa gunekiziyi neni ntumintumi gwaku, toziya ntenda shitwatira sha ungalimahala nakamu.”<verse eid="2SA 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 24:11" />Pamberi Dawudi keniimuki mandawira yakuyi, shaka ashi Mtuwa Mlungu kampananiti ulagilagi mbuyi gwa Mlungu Gadi mlola gwa mfalumi Dawudi, pakalonga, <verse eid="2SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 24:12" />“Gugendi gwakamgambiri Dawudi hangu. Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu. Hanikupanani mirandu mitatu na gwenga gulisyaguliri gumu na neni hanikutenderi.” <verse eid="2SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 24:13" />Hangu, mlola Gadi kamgendera Dawudi na kumgambira, “Hashi, gufira njala ya mivinja saba isoki kuisi yaku? Ama hashi, gwenga guwatugi wankondu waku kwa miezi mitatu pawakutugiziya? Ama kuweri na mashaka matatu geni isi yaku hayiweri na malweri madoda? Guliholi gunupi lyankulu lyanfira kumpanana yomberi yakantumiti.”<verse eid="2SA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 24:14" />Dawudi kamwankula mbuyi gwa Mlungu Gadi, “Nana lyoga likulu! Mbaka nkomangwi na Mtuwa Mlungu, kuliku kutuluwa mumakakala ga wantu, toziya yomberi kana lusungu nentu.”<verse eid="2SA 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 24:15" />Su, Mtuwa Mlungu kawajegera Waisraeli malweri, kwanjira mandawira mpaka shaka shashitulitwi. Wantu elufu sabini wahowiti muisi yoseri kulawa Dani ya uwega wa kushana mpaka Beeri Sheba ya uwega wa kusika. <verse eid="2SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 24:16" />Kumbiti shaka ntumintumi gwa kumpindi yakatalipisiyiti liwoku lyakuyi su kukomanga mji gwa Yerusalemu. Mtuwa Mlungu kagalambula nfiru yakuyi. Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira ntumintumi gwa kumpindi ayu yakatenditi malaga kwa wantu, “Goyi, guwuziyi ligumba lyaku.” Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti kagoloka pakwegera na luwaga lwa kukomera viboga lwa Arauna, muntu gwa likabila lya Yebusi.<verse eid="2SA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 24:17" />Dawudi pakamwoniti ntumintumi gwa kumpindi ulii yakaweriti kankuwalaga wantu, kamgambiriti Mtuwa Mlungu, “Guloli, Neni ndo ntenda vidoda! Wantu awa watenda ndiri ukontola. Nikuluwa Nentu gunkomangi neni na walongu wa tati gwangu.”<verse eid="2SA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 24:18" />Lishaka liraali Gadi kamgendera Dawudi, kamgambira, “Gukweni pampindi, muluwaga lwa kukomera viboga lwa Arauna muntu gwa likabila lyab Yebusi gwakamnyawiri Mtuwa Mlungu shitalawanda.” <verse eid="2SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 24:19" />Su Dawudi kakwena pampindi kulawirana na shisoweru sha Gadi gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamgambiriti. <verse eid="2SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 24:20" />Arauna pakaloliti uwega wa pasi kamwoniti mfalumi na wantu wakuyi pawamwizira, yomberi kalawa kagenda na kumsundamalira mfalumi, kang'ong'onala mpaka pasi palitapaka. <verse eid="2SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 24:21" />Shakapanu Aruana kamkosiya mfalumi, “Ntambu gaa mtuwa gwangu mfalumi gunizira neni ntumintumi gwaku?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:21">Dawudi kamwankula, “Niza kuhemera luwaga lwaku lwa kukomera viboga su nimnyawiri Mtuwa Mlungu shitalawanda sha kutambikira su ulweli upeli.”<verse eid="2SA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 24:22" />Arauna kamgambira Dawudi, “Mtuwa gwangu mfalumi, gutoli shoseri shaguwona shifaa na gulaviliri tambiku. Neni ndaviya wang'ombi washipalu wa tambiku ya kulunguziwa na vintu avi vya kukomera na vipingili vya kutawira ng'ombi kuwera mbawu.” <verse eid="2SA 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 24:23" />Vyoseri avi, gwee mfalumi nikupanana, “Nivimana Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku, hakayijimiri tambiku yaku.”<verse eid="2SA 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 24:24" />Kumbiti mfalumi kamgambira Arauna, “Ndala! Gwenga nagumpanani shoseri pota kuhemera. Hanivihemeri kwa gwenga kwa beyi yakuyi. Hapeni nimlaviliri Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwangu, tambiku za kulunguziwa zeni hanenilaviyi shintu.” Hangu, mfalumi Dawudi kahemeliti luwaga lwa kukomera viboga na ng'ombi shipalu na vipandi hamusini vya madini ga feza. <verse eid="2SA 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 24:25" />Shakapanu Dawudi kamnyawira Mtuwa Mlungu shitalawanda pahala panu na kumlavilira tambiku za kulunguziwa na za ponga. Hangu Mtuwa Mlungu kagajimira maluwa ga Dawudu na ulweli woya muisi ya Israeli.<verse eid="2SA 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 24" />
</usx>